{"duration_api_ms":640443,"stop_reason":"tool_use","session_id":"56a8d95a-d56a-4713-9fbb-2358c36e954a","total_cost_usd":4.81774,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":439494,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":65089,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":40881},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":439494,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":65089,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":439494,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":4.81774,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":40881,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":2,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"kind\":\"semantic_job_asset_candidate\",\"schemaVersion\":\"5.0.0\",\"asset\":{\"kind\":\"semantic_stage_asset_candidate\",\"schemaVersion\":\"5.0.0\",\"requirementCandidates\":[],\"worksiteDesign\":null,\"statements\":[{\"statementRef\":\"evidence-statement:01-evidence-basis\",\"modality\":\"supporting\",\"obligationRefs\":[],\"requirementRefs\":[],\"predecessorStatementRefs\":[\"design-statement:14-dependencies-and-readiness\",\"design-statement:06-native-execution\",\"requirement-statement:21-source-role\"],\"sourceQuotes\":[],\"text\":\"This asset binds one construction record and one command-execution record, both selected as admitted execution evidence.\\n\\nConstruction:\\n- native-work-observation://abiogenesis/b17961c3865b64b65275692cd892ea5fb59e9c7fbe9ef14335e751b903c06479\\n- result result://abiogenesis/e14ee1f3df7ac6292eba353ccf7b9cb000c5c25d4f49e0d997577b22ea61bb36\\n- c-call b28cfddc…; disposition admitted; judgment advance\\n- One activation wrote all 14 targets. changedPaths lists exactly the eight subject surfaces, the six verification scripts and their directories.\\n\\nExecution:\\n- worksite-command-execution-observation://abiogenesis/f3f8fc59b60766b8deea3c9c0e119bceb2f11ab5ac09b8a699dfc6d500c1cb85\\n- execution result result://abiogenesis/5f743236d9c21a82eb4da9d1fff8590403ae087db386f1a32d7d6c39b46ac8f5\\n- task 3f90ed65…\\n- actor actor://abiogenesis/worksite/command-execution-worker@5, lane worker_executes, one tool call\\n- snapshot worksite-command-snapshot://abiogenesis/4c4a716cd9fc11040acaea35f185bbb16f3631a3e1e88760dfc9d23e3ce983b7\\n- Its sourceNativeWork is the same construction observation, b17961c3….\\n\\nThe identities agree:\\n- All 15 snapshot members carry the same file digest as the artifact bodies presented here, and each names that body's construction-time worksite observation. The 15 members are the 14 targets plus the job-source copy (sha256:c799b9e4…, 6120 bytes).\\n- Construction and execution share workspace binding 3f9a41f2… and authority basis c2f9961f….\\n- All nine commands and all 13 predicate observations therefore ran over exactly the bodies bound in this asset.\\n- worksiteDelta and productDelta are both empty, so execution changed no subject file.\\n\\nI found no wrong identity in these links. These records establish the recorded execution only. They do not show current physical state, and a later edit to any bound surface makes the affected evidence stale.\"},{\"statementRef\":\"evidence-statement:02-command-record\",\"modality\":\"supporting\",\"obligationRefs\":[],\"requirementRefs\":[],\"predecessorStatementRefs\":[\"design-statement:06-native-execution\"],\"sourceQuotes\":[],\"text\":\"Command record. All nine commands ran with the same settings:\\n- executable /opt/homebrew/Cellar/node/24.7.0/bin/node\\n- relativeCwd \\\".\\\"\\n- no expected reports\\n- exit status 0, no process signal, not timed out, termination confirmed\\n- empty stderr: 0 bytes, sha256:e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855\\n\\nWorksite-command-observation refs:\\n- planned-verifier-run, args [\\\"--test\\\", \\\"test/component/hello.test.mjs\\\", \\\"test/uat/hello.uat.test.mjs\\\"], timeout 30000 ms: 16ae72256f5551f7cfd2fc80f7822c98b3cec23541f13ceb0bca82d4d32c4160. Stdout 266 bytes, sha256:6f9ba47c6bf8b8a1c69878fd62f4214ae8f8cfec6f8db33ce2e7885343b021ec.\\n- component-suite-run, args [\\\"--test\\\", \\\"test/component/hello.test.mjs\\\"], timeout 30000 ms: f1e7c2a36d7f9177b7db4b6fe9f1fbe22388835e06b29dd55305d24244ad6642. Stdout 187 bytes, sha256:9efd9b851d1349a37e36d9f4c14acd07d3a11f934040085dcc50fdbd09e07df4.\\n- uat-suite-run, args [\\\"--test\\\", \\\"test/uat/hello.uat.test.mjs\\\"], timeout 30000 ms: ffc9477fdc764606f37e25d0896949a2ca9dd074f33ef696fe901c15475aa9b1. Stdout 198 bytes, sha256:53c70c5ec032980d93f1500dadf7d115607530361f6c2bee1a1d114f87cc026d.\\n- Six checkers, each with timeout 15000 ms:\\n  - check-inventory 095ac79b7807f91012ea0719f31e6a0abafb09eb39830812c575c0708a80c7d9: 20 checks, 0 failures\\n  - check-package d278437d134b53c630d5c433c9f70b0a03f3099987e3780a8b8f0dd0d30c490b: 4 checks, 0 failures\\n  - check-documents 462e629bd590e7ad0a9327c29b7fa6e00d7392ae423db7bdf7c774f8fda809f9: 24 checks, 0 failures\\n  - check-verifier-structure 809b0ea238de96179809e85d6cb9581503cfbe55ad7ff7857c170e85528eeec3: 24 checks, 0 failures\\n  - check-plan 6e50483ff7d581cdde55119679b88c21ff68ab6de634898339fe15b687edfa21: 11 checks, 0 failures\\n  - check-derivation 7ce5daf2c74a9cb3f8971e252abd8d12fadb508e06fc7503d83d0a57acb37ea5: 10 checks, 0 failures\\n\\nThe same record holds 13 predicate observations:\\n- process_exit observed 0 for all nine commands\\n- test_pass_count observed 2 for planned-verifier-run, and 1 for each suite run\\n- module_export_return_exact observed \\\"Hello, world!\\\"\\n\\nThe record carries observed values only. The selected evidence contains no separate per-predicate verdict and no per-condition evaluator record.\\n\\nThe executed commands carried HOME, LANG=C.UTF-8, LC_ALL=C.UTF-8, PATH and TMPDIR, although the Design and the capability declared environment {}. Both points are carried as pressure.\"},{\"statementRef\":\"evidence-statement:03-runner-output-reading\",\"modality\":\"supporting\",\"obligationRefs\":[\"obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/41e61751720255f4a6b9c890ac9b248dbd8841700d0b0b7c22b99fb04e41fba0\",\"obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/87511aff478a1e4700ba794c4bd0449e66ba1c22bf8a6aa69d736ae0eb862d69\",\"obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/ef532097a24726244bf79cc637e15990ea8dcdd8740453dea9d74b89645d5fe3\"],\"requirementRefs\":[\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/88958828d9af4ca553462c38b29d8514f35242708d8a0492cca59db11f457ed0\",\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/31fcd6813562347ff58ee3be2eed9320788c8a8ea87ec9d16a71e1fb994dae55\",\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/d8d166906884606b13f9a636db2c1efd2c9718e4c7984b671b0c92df67d5ebe9\"],\"predecessorStatementRefs\":[\"design-statement:07-acceptance-computation\"],\"sourceQuotes\":[{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"expectedStdoutMatch must include stable zero-failure evidence such as fail 0\"}],\"text\":\"Planned-run stdout, verbatim (sha256:6f9ba47c…):\\n\\n✔ component: helloWorld() returns exactly 'Hello, world!' (0.28ms)\\n✔ uat: the user-visible greeting contract is exactly 'Hello, world!' (0.27825ms)\\nℹ tests 2\\nℹ suites 0\\nℹ pass 2\\nℹ fail 0\\nℹ cancelled 0\\nℹ skipped 0\\nℹ todo 0\\nℹ duration_ms 35.576875\\n\\nEach suite run shows one ✔ line with the matching name prefix, followed by 'ℹ tests 1', 'ℹ pass 1' and 'ℹ fail 0'. Under this capture Node 24.7.0 used the spec reporter, not TAP. The test_pass_count parser handled this output: its recorded values 2, 1 and 1 agree with the 'ℹ pass' lines.\\n\\nThese stdout readings are this author's judgment (J), not admitted computations. They do not close G1 or G2.\"},{\"statementRef\":\"evidence-statement:04-greeting-return-value\",\"modality\":\"normative\",\"obligationRefs\":[\"obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/b0d4821ca26232eeb993447f56e6af622e2b392cd82a274e9005ad742d88ac1a\"],\"requirementRefs\":[\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/6cec93b453f2df9b331e5908febb36e581998805218c49fab406ce4e9370a287\"],\"predecessorStatementRefs\":[\"requirement-statement:01-greeting-return-value\",\"design-statement:02-implementation-realization\",\"design-statement:04-verifiers\"],\"sourceQuotes\":[{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"src/hello.mjs must export helloWorld() returning exactly\"},{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"expectedReturnValue: \\\"Hello, world!\\\"\"},{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"Assert helloWorld() returns exactly\"}],\"text\":\"Obligation 0, greeting return value.\\n\\nRealization: src/hello.mjs (worksite-observation 94c1ae47…, 108 bytes) is exactly:\\n// Derived from design/implementation-design.md.\\nexport function helloWorld() {\\n  return \\\"Hello, world!\\\";\\n}\\nhelloWorld is a synchronous named export that returns the literal directly. The module has no import, no default export, and no console or process use.\\n\\nVerifier artifacts: both test files. Each has the exact import and assert.strictEqual(helloWorld(), \\\"Hello, world!\\\").\\n\\nVerifier execution:\\n- planned-verifier-run exited 0 with empty stderr.\\n- planned-run-exit-zero observed 0; planned-run-pass-floor observed 2.\\n- The typed observation hello-world-return-exact observed \\\"Hello, world!\\\" against the same module observation 94c1ae47… (see obligation 14).\\n\\nSemantic assessment: the independent assessment is still outstanding. This author's reading finds that the body and assertions match the source and the Design.\\n\\nSupported: helloWorld() returned the literal in the recorded execution.\\nNot yet shown by an admitted computation: separate component and UAT passes inside the planned run (G2).\\nUnconstrained and unproved: behavior with arguments, other exports and side effects. No run shows a verifier failing on a wrong greeting.\"},{\"statementRef\":\"evidence-statement:05-package-manifest\",\"modality\":\"normative\",\"obligationRefs\":[\"obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/8db452e0e1bbc88e188c860d05a9a00b190c4c8efaac86d1867545807141dd0f\"],\"requirementRefs\":[\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/4b0d0a5472f2dbc0912370d9aa5ecc33c0ebc755c95186c390e96f73c97b077d\"],\"predecessorStatementRefs\":[\"requirement-statement:02-package-manifest\",\"design-statement:02-implementation-realization\"],\"sourceQuotes\":[{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"package.json must be private:true and type:module.\"}],\"text\":\"Obligation 1, package manifest.\\n\\nRealization: package.json (worksite-observation 148ef636…, 42 bytes) is exactly {\\\"private\\\": true, \\\"type\\\": \\\"module\\\"}, with no other key.\\n\\nVerifier artifact: verification/check-package.mjs, which is read-only.\\n\\nVerifier execution:\\n- check-package exited 0.\\n- Its stdout printed 'digest package.json sha256:609158e6…' and ok for package-parses, private-true, type-module and keys-exact.\\n- check-package-exit-zero observed 0.\\n\\nSupported: private === true and type === \\\"module\\\" in the bound body. The planned node --test run is not evidence for these fields: .mjs files load as ES modules regardless of type, and private has no runtime effect. Independent semantic assessment is outstanding.\"},{\"statementRef\":\"evidence-statement:06-return-value-only-surface\",\"modality\":\"normative\",\"obligationRefs\":[\"obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/7a8b5b917def2cca68739c356b11768944ef192b5c4466b73b395e574e4d2c32\"],\"requirementRefs\":[\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/627fab4b7eeee0bed12887d25fca8034acfec37855c7dd4091af9adbe4c3b80b\"],\"predecessorStatementRefs\":[\"requirement-statement:03-return-value-only-surface\",\"product-statement:03-no-program-output\"],\"sourceQuotes\":[{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"expectedStdout: null\"}],\"text\":\"Obligation 2, return value as the only greeting surface.\\n\\nRealization:\\n- package.json has no bin, scripts, main, exports or dependencies.\\n- src/hello.mjs has no console or process use.\\n- Both verifiers assert the return value, not stdout.\\n\\nVerifier artifacts: check-inventory, check-package and check-verifier-structure.\\n\\nVerifier execution (all three exited 0):\\n- check-package: keys-exact ok.\\n- check-verifier-structure: component-no-doubles-or-output and uat-no-doubles-or-output ok.\\n- check-inventory: root-entries ok (no node_modules, no bin, no note lines) and no-authored-result ok.\\n\\nIn runner stdout the greeting appears only inside test names. That is verifier output, not subject output.\\n\\nSupported over the command snapshot. For the live post-construction worksite, absence rests on the construction changedPaths and the empty worksiteDelta, because the after-construction inventory body is not selected. Whether importing the module writes any output is neither required nor proved.\"},{\"statementRef\":\"evidence-statement:07-governed-surface-set\",\"modality\":\"normative\",\"obligationRefs\":[\"obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/5424a144e7721982c9b4dd6c6a7511e0707e85f2fb11fa5f192774000623378f\"],\"requirementRefs\":[\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/206f06fea56b5a9a64d066ed597f7f3f57940ee9838caf0f2a41c2375cc8fa70\"],\"predecessorStatementRefs\":[\"requirement-statement:04-governed-surface-set\",\"design-statement:01-subject-topology\"],\"sourceQuotes\":[{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"Name package.json, src/hello.mjs, design/test-design.md, test/component/hello.test.mjs, test/uat/hello.uat.test.mjs, test-execution-plan.json, and execution result as separate lifecycle surfaces.\"},{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"Produce no files.\"}],\"text\":\"Obligation 3, governed surface set.\\n\\nThe eight surfaces exist as separate files at the source-given paths. Each is bound to its construction-time worksite observation and its snapshot member:\\n- specification/project-conformance.md: sha256:148e9bb1fd6dd2c39121e3e141e8a46b22cae5912e670cc04f3a2b0ec7799a3a, 1182 bytes\\n- design/implementation-design.md: sha256:2a5acf0f055983bf757cf1324669be609ddedddb753db03e4e2897e6fc370ee3, 946 bytes\\n- package.json: sha256:609158e6c5fbc237939fa3ddf7faab80ab690bdc0c8d584414a885130103c4e8, 42 bytes\\n- src/hello.mjs: sha256:e62ab9f36107d91297bcb4433418a4a1911d2081724ea141bc848d1d8acde924, 108 bytes\\n- design/test-design.md: sha256:17fcb06fcf2253a475b296772b8a15569522be2632b9c398c63181d56bef90df, 1104 bytes\\n- test/component/hello.test.mjs: sha256:4eefc99756ee34640b1e2c8baecb9ff4fa199d8d014d6ed935fe5bec7a9f031b, 312 bytes\\n- test/uat/hello.uat.test.mjs: sha256:42bf7e724edf073aeb23f0e9b1d5dabf66a63ce444c51c3502303fd9d3332e82, 354 bytes\\n- test-execution-plan.json: sha256:c69ed6ca8f50ba55e59ff4a841856cb977a63ebdf6d2c98b81e35ba62af4ed7d, 300 bytes\\n\\nThe design-selected verifier artifacts are separate files:\\n- verification/check-inventory.mjs: sha256:327d0fdb5a67ddf7e3a4b6eee6d770a7f4f57402423abebb5ce75df18c2a517\\n- check-package.mjs: sha256:ef9d65362094704dd1a8927e2abf4ac99e8660ffb650793b7b7843b4dba1552a\\n- check-documents.mjs: sha256:21537559351303205f7264f78b6c400059057cc85a1d323c99c18029356218dd\\n- check-verifier-structure.mjs: sha256:59296f62425a051fab2ed5e6e9de942921da5165faab9c5fc68d1f54c090fbc7\\n- check-plan.mjs: sha256:dadf87cd9c1b7e410451c74ece70574a31966098a3954b53949da9b3e5bbd746\\n- check-derivation.mjs: sha256:491e7edbefd97b322fe6bd514c147d7448b6c2ef0e7fee94c5b2c1d260059668\\n\\nThe job-source copy is the only other snapshot member.\\n\\nVerifier execution: check-inventory exited 0 with 20 checks and 0 failures.\\n- surface ok for all eight paths\\n- exact-set ok for specification, design, src, test and verification\\n- no-authored-result ok\\n- root-entries ok\\n- The digests it printed equal the list above.\\n\\nNo execution-result file was authored. The result exists only as the command record (obligation 10). Presence alone proves no content requirement; content is bound under obligations 0 to 9.\"},{\"statementRef\":\"evidence-statement:08-conformance-document\",\"modality\":\"normative\",\"obligationRefs\":[\"obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/8192562fedfdf16555663296ac3d61c1d3361b2dd9e50bb50d98ffd26f4cd843\"],\"requirementRefs\":[\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/088b36dcb16f9fc6fb6bc9b1bb35f156d0c18d2f29833287e2d9302196d903ea\"],\"predecessorStatementRefs\":[\"requirement-statement:05-conformance-document\",\"design-statement:03-governing-documents\"],\"sourceQuotes\":[{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"Declare the project pressure for a JavaScript Hello World software build traversal.\"},{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"Name the required downstream lifecycle surfaces: implementation design, source, test design, component test source, UAT test source, test execution plan, and test execution result.\"},{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"State that ABG owns startup admission, registry selection, graph-call opening, vector traversal, F_P dispatch, evidence admission, event emission, closure, and convergence.\"}],\"text\":\"Obligation 4, conformance document.\\n\\nRealization: specification/project-conformance.md (worksite-observation 50d205db…) contains:\\n- the sentence 'This project declares the project pressure for a JavaScript Hello World software build traversal.'\\n- a section 'Required downstream lifecycle surfaces' with seven bullets: implementation design, source, test design, component test source, UAT test source, test execution plan, test execution result\\n- the ABG-ownership sentence verbatim, followed by a note that it describes the building environment, grants no authority, and places no runtime, registry, ledger, controller, scheduler or traversal machinery in the subject\\n- 'This document is the authority for design/implementation-design.md.'\\n\\nIt also restates two points: the only public behavior is a return value with no stdout, CLI, HTTP, UI or deployment surface, and the execution result has no authored file. This added text is consistent with the source and the requirements and does not widen scope.\\n\\nVerifier execution: check-documents exited 0 and printed digest sha256:148e9bb1…. All of these printed ok:\\n- conformance-pressure\\n- the seven conformance-surface checks\\n- conformance-ownership (exact match)\\n- conformance-authority-for-design\\n\\nSupported: every required element is present. Faithfulness and sufficiency await independent assessment.\\n\\nThe 'source' surface check is vacuous as a substring test, because it also matches 'component test source'. The body does list source as its own bullet. Whether the predecessor ABG vocabulary matches the current native lifecycle is unassessed.\"},{\"statementRef\":\"evidence-statement:09-implementation-design-document\",\"modality\":\"normative\",\"obligationRefs\":[\"obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/7010ec2a96c88bd2d24ad996e6886455f71045c20bfdec4344e35e3867f4b681\"],\"requirementRefs\":[\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/3e9025692e1fd4b454ea40c9695fa2b37c662812a79169a50099d8fd1ab54210\"],\"predecessorStatementRefs\":[\"requirement-statement:06-implementation-design-document\",\"design-statement:03-governing-documents\",\"design-statement:10-derivation-direction\"],\"sourceQuotes\":[{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"Use the prior conformance_project artifact as the authority.\"},{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"Define a minimal JavaScript module that exports helloWorld() returning exactly\"}],\"text\":\"Obligation 5, implementation design.\\n\\nRealization: design/implementation-design.md (worksite-observation 34b858a6…) contains:\\n- 'Authority: specification/project-conformance.md', and a sentence deriving the document from it\\n- the minimal module: a named, synchronous helloWorld() that returns exactly \\\"Hello, world!\\\" directly, with no imports, no default export and no output\\n- package.json as exactly \\\"private\\\": true and \\\"type\\\": \\\"module\\\", with no other field\\n- the separate surfaces package.json, src/hello.mjs, design/test-design.md, test/component/hello.test.mjs, test/uat/hello.uat.test.mjs, test-execution-plan.json and execution result\\n- a statement that the execution result has no file and is realized only by admitted native execution\\n\\nVerifier execution:\\n- check-documents: design-authority, design-module, the seven design-surface checks and design-package-fields all ok\\n- check-derivation: edge-conformance-design ok\\n\\nSupported: the required content and the named authority edge are present.\\n\\nGap G3: the conformance digest is not in this document's admitted construction basis. check-derivation printed 'note construction-basis-not-admitted edge-conformance-design'.\"},{\"statementRef\":\"evidence-statement:10-test-design-document\",\"modality\":\"normative\",\"obligationRefs\":[\"obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/6c446dc68415a8717adac85c42a0f98efb3bbcc66e8011538333346f232334df\"],\"requirementRefs\":[\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/d3d8ed21b5d15af3a3a3bf1ccd3ff5adf06b9e202ca112bfbbc7195c5d0d54ba\"],\"predecessorStatementRefs\":[\"requirement-statement:07-test-design-document\",\"design-statement:03-governing-documents\"],\"sourceQuotes\":[{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"Specify both component and UAT validation obligations.\"},{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"The UAT test must validate the user-visible greeting contract through the same exported function.\"},{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"Use the prior source artifact summaries as the evidence source.\"}],\"text\":\"Obligation 6, test design.\\n\\nRealization: design/test-design.md (worksite-observation 17c2fd58…) contains:\\n- 'Evidence source: package.json and src/hello.mjs', with the package and export facts\\n- the component obligation: import helloWorld from src/hello.mjs and assert by strict equality that the result is exactly \\\"Hello, world!\\\"\\n- the UAT obligation: validate the user-visible greeting contract through the same exported function, for a JavaScript consumer that imports and calls helloWorld\\n- shared constraints: node:test and node:assert/strict; one test() per file; 'component:' and 'uat:' name prefixes; no skip, todo, only, describe or it; no stdout or CLI\\n\\nVerifier execution:\\n- check-documents: test-design-evidence-source, test-design-component, test-design-uat and test-design-libraries all ok\\n- check-derivation: edge-source-test-design ok\\n\\nSupported: both obligations are present and consistent with the bound src/hello.mjs.\\n\\nGap G3: the package.json and src/hello.mjs digests are not in this document's construction basis. Whether artifact summaries or artifact bodies are the evidence source remains unruled.\"},{\"statementRef\":\"evidence-statement:11-component-verifier\",\"modality\":\"normative\",\"obligationRefs\":[\"obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/4aa9ffafc520b40c7d18e7b1d37d231d8a7c806bb60cd7dfd18678193503506d\"],\"requirementRefs\":[\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/2ac1b260a4c172edf2c948ed18390b42302657bec15407901409728e5e2e5ad3\"],\"predecessorStatementRefs\":[\"requirement-statement:08-component-verifier\",\"design-statement:04-verifiers\",\"design-statement:13-proof-role-mapping\"],\"sourceQuotes\":[{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"Assert helloWorld() returns exactly\"},{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"Use the prior test_design and source artifact summaries as the evidence source.\"}],\"text\":\"Obligation 7, component verifier.\\n\\nRealization: test/component/hello.test.mjs (worksite-observation 9e55d76e…). The file is itself the realization here and is tagged verifier by path. It contains:\\n- the derivation comment naming design/test-design.md and src/hello.mjs\\n- import { test } from \\\"node:test\\\"; import assert from \\\"node:assert/strict\\\"; import { helloWorld } from \\\"../../src/hello.mjs\\\"\\n- one test, test(\\\"component: helloWorld() returns exactly 'Hello, world!'\\\"), containing assert.strictEqual(helloWorld(), \\\"Hello, world!\\\")\\n\\nVerifier artifact: check-verifier-structure.mjs.\\n\\nVerifier execution:\\n- check-verifier-structure exited 0 and printed digest sha256:4eefc997….\\n- All eleven component checks printed ok: node-test, assert-strict, exact-import, import-set, resolves-to-subject, strict-assertion, name-prefix, single-test, no-other-test-forms, no-skip-or-focus, no-doubles-or-output.\\n- component-suite-run exited 0, with test_pass_count 1.\\n\\nSupported: the file meets its structural requirement and passes when run alone.\\n\\nInside planned-verifier-run, the stdout names the passing 'component:' test, but no admitted predicate attributes that pass to this file (G2).\"},{\"statementRef\":\"evidence-statement:12-uat-verifier\",\"modality\":\"normative\",\"obligationRefs\":[\"obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/0b94d7680d5b9fe54ac5f469ca8a369ed85751db38a4561f5a088d7500443d78\"],\"requirementRefs\":[\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/221df643ebe7e2b283bc56db2ae7e674def6ca0cdc88ba89c7b0e645ea40dd71\"],\"predecessorStatementRefs\":[\"requirement-statement:09-uat-verifier\",\"design-statement:04-verifiers\",\"design-statement:13-proof-role-mapping\"],\"sourceQuotes\":[{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"Assert the user-visible greeting contract is exactly\"},{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"Use the prior component_test_source, test_design, and source artifact summaries as the evidence source.\"}],\"text\":\"Obligation 8, UAT verifier.\\n\\nRealization: test/uat/hello.uat.test.mjs (worksite-observation a2a556db…). The file is itself the realization here and is tagged verifier by path. It contains:\\n- a derivation comment naming test/component/hello.test.mjs, design/test-design.md and src/hello.mjs\\n- the same three exact imports as the component verifier\\n- one test, test(\\\"uat: the user-visible greeting contract is exactly 'Hello, world!'\\\"), containing assert.strictEqual(helloWorld(), \\\"Hello, world!\\\")\\n\\nVerifier execution:\\n- check-verifier-structure printed digest sha256:42bf7e72… and ok for all eleven uat checks.\\n- verifiers-distinct and verifiers-total-tests printed ok.\\n- uat-suite-run exited 0, with test_pass_count 1.\\n\\nSupported: the file meets its structural requirement and passes when run alone. It invents no CLI or stdout surface, and differs from the component file only in role, file, test name and comment.\\n\\nAttribution of this file's pass inside the planned run is not computed by an admitted predicate (G2).\"},{\"statementRef\":\"evidence-statement:13-execution-plan\",\"modality\":\"normative\",\"obligationRefs\":[\"obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/41e61751720255f4a6b9c890ac9b248dbd8841700d0b0b7c22b99fb04e41fba0\"],\"requirementRefs\":[\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/88958828d9af4ca553462c38b29d8514f35242708d8a0492cca59db11f457ed0\"],\"predecessorStatementRefs\":[\"requirement-statement:10-execution-plan\",\"design-statement:05-execution-plan\"],\"sourceQuotes\":[{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"The command must be node with args\"},{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"expectedTestPassCount must be at least 2, matching the admitted component and UAT coverage floor.\"},{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"expectedStdoutMatch must include stable zero-failure evidence such as fail 0\"},{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"assertedReturnValue must be\"},{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"Use the prior component_test_source and uat_test_source artifact summaries as the evidence source.\"}],\"text\":\"Obligation 9, execution plan.\\n\\nRealization: test-execution-plan.json (worksite-observation d3135ed3…) declares:\\n- command \\\"node\\\"\\n- args [\\\"--test\\\", \\\"test/component/hello.test.mjs\\\", \\\"test/uat/hello.uat.test.mjs\\\"]\\n- expectedTestPassCount 2\\n- expectedStdoutMatch \\\"fail 0\\\"\\n- assertedReturnValue \\\"Hello, world!\\\"\\n- derivedFrom, naming both verifiers\\nIt has no observed-result field.\\n\\nVerifier execution:\\n- check-plan exited 0 and printed ok for all eleven checks, together with the digests of the plan and both verifiers.\\n- check-derivation: edge-verifiers-plan ok.\\n- planned-verifier-run used exactly the plan's args with the admitted node executable, over the plan at sha256:c69ed6ca….\\n\\nSupported: every declared value is present and agrees with the verifiers.\\n\\nNot computed: the comparison of expectedStdoutMatch with the planned run's stdout (G1). The admitted spec-reporter stdout visibly contains 'ℹ fail 0', but that is a reading, not a computation.\\n\\nGap G3: the verifier digests are not in the plan's construction basis.\"},{\"statementRef\":\"evidence-statement:14-observed-execution-result\",\"modality\":\"normative\",\"obligationRefs\":[\"obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/87511aff478a1e4700ba794c4bd0449e66ba1c22bf8a6aa69d736ae0eb862d69\"],\"requirementRefs\":[\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/31fcd6813562347ff58ee3be2eed9320788c8a8ea87ec9d16a71e1fb994dae55\"],\"predecessorStatementRefs\":[\"requirement-statement:11-observed-execution-result\",\"design-statement:06-native-execution\",\"design-statement:07-acceptance-computation\"],\"sourceQuotes\":[{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"Produce no files.\"},{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"Judge the observed executionStatus, planSatisfied flag, observedTestPassCount, and stdout digest against the prior test_execution_plan.\"}],\"text\":\"Obligation 10, observed execution result.\\n\\nRealization: the planned-verifier-run record, 16ae7225…, within execution result 5f743236…. It carries:\\n- command, args and working directory\\n- exit status 0\\n- stdout and stderr, with digests\\n- run identity: execution observation f3f8fc59…, actor invocation beed8878…\\n- consumed surface digests: the members of snapshot 4c4a716c…, which equal the constructed bodies\\n\\nNo authored result file exists: check-inventory no-authored-result is ok and worksiteDelta is empty.\\n\\nVerifier artifacts: the plan, at the consumed digest c69ed6ca…, and the declared predicates.\\n\\nVerifier execution (C2):\\n- executionStatus comes from planned-run-exit-zero, observed 0.\\n- observedTestPassCount comes from planned-run-pass-floor, observed 2.\\n- The stdout digest is sha256:6f9ba47c…, taken from the record.\\n\\nNo admitted computation derives the per-suite results inside this run (G2) or planSatisfied (G1). The derivation of the result fields is therefore incomplete. This is a recorded ABI gap, not a subject defect.\"},{\"statementRef\":\"evidence-statement:15-acceptance-predicate\",\"modality\":\"normative\",\"obligationRefs\":[\"obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/ef532097a24726244bf79cc637e15990ea8dcdd8740453dea9d74b89645d5fe3\"],\"requirementRefs\":[\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/d8d166906884606b13f9a636db2c1efd2c9718e4c7984b671b0c92df67d5ebe9\"],\"predecessorStatementRefs\":[\"requirement-statement:12-acceptance-predicate\",\"design-statement:07-acceptance-computation\",\"product-statement:14-acceptance-predicate\"],\"sourceQuotes\":[{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"Accept only if both component and UAT tests passed, planSatisfied is true, and observedTestPassCount is at least the prior test_execution_plan expectedTestPassCount.\"},{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"Do not reject solely because node:test uses a different TAP prefix glyph when the F_D pass-count check is satisfied.\"}],\"text\":\"Obligation 11, acceptance predicate, evaluated over planned-verifier-run.\\n\\n1. observedTestPassCount at least expectedTestPassCount: holds by computation. The observed count is 2 and the plan requires 2. check-plan plan-pass-floor-matches-predicate shows the predicate literal equals the plan value.\\n\\n2. Component passed, and 3. UAT passed: not established by an admitted observation of each suite. Every input of rule D-suite is observed true:\\n   - exit status 0 and pass count 2\\n   - check-plan plan-args ok\\n   - check-verifier-structure single-test ok for both files, verifiers-total-tests ok, and 'note suite-attribution-basis component=1 uat=1'\\n   The stdout also shows ✔ lines for both named tests, and each separate suite run passed. However, the requirement forbids inferring suite passes from an aggregate count, so G2 still blocks.\\n\\n4. planSatisfied: every clause that can be computed holds. The command and args equal the plan, exit status is 0, the floor holds, check-plan shows assertedReturnValue equals expectedReturnValue, and the typed observation equals the declared value. The clause requiring the fragment to occur in stdout has no admitted computation (G1).\\n\\nThe TAP-glyph tolerance is not needed: the run used the spec reporter and no failure was observed, so the tolerance excuses nothing.\\n\\nNo per-condition evaluator record exists. The acceptance predicate is not established. Acceptance is an owner ruling, and the source names no acceptor. Nothing in this asset accepts the result.\"},{\"statementRef\":\"evidence-statement:16-derivation-dependency\",\"modality\":\"normative\",\"obligationRefs\":[\"obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/b9db7693ff6fc70946aedf347e7b347347e79100ea077c6d87c0f9bf7a7aca09\"],\"requirementRefs\":[\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/9a46a12976a1020d5ab1e12524f47719058ff6b9e5bb78fff621d8f120938321\"],\"predecessorStatementRefs\":[\"requirement-statement:13-derivation-dependency\",\"design-statement:10-derivation-direction\"],\"sourceQuotes\":[{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"Use the prior conformance_project artifact as the authority.\"},{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"Use the prior implementation_design artifact as the authority.\"},{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"Use the prior test_design and source artifact summaries as the evidence source.\"}],\"text\":\"Obligation 12, derivation dependency.\\n\\nRealization: each dependent names its predecessor.\\n- The implementation design cites the conformance document.\\n- src/hello.mjs names the implementation design.\\n- The test design names package.json and src/hello.mjs as its evidence source.\\n- The component verifier names the test design and src/hello.mjs.\\n- The UAT verifier names the component verifier, the test design and src/hello.mjs.\\n- The plan's derivedFrom names both verifiers and equals args.slice(1).\\n\\nVerifier execution: check-derivation exited 0.\\n- Six edge checks and four fact checks printed ok. The fact checks cover function name, return value, module path and verifier paths.\\n- The digests it printed for all eight surfaces equal the constructed bodies.\\n- It printed 'note construction-basis-not-admitted' for each edge, and 'note derivation-order-not-observable'.\\n\\nSupported: the edges are named in the source's direction, and the surfaces are consistent with each other.\\n\\nUnproved (G3): one construction activation wrote all 14 targets, so no predecessor digest is in a dependent's admitted construction basis. The constructor's report that it wrote the files in source order is a self-report, not an observation.\"},{\"statementRef\":\"evidence-statement:17-no-copied-machinery\",\"modality\":\"normative\",\"obligationRefs\":[\"obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/999a34a746108698bce32c4926643d0d2cb6bb18aed1e6337025d7ad03d346c3\"],\"requirementRefs\":[\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/bc22ead80214da5fb40b552a5a4045a6b8554f1130fa14c0034f01b8a12c6b47\"],\"predecessorStatementRefs\":[\"requirement-statement:14-no-copied-predecessor-machinery\",\"design-statement:11-no-copied-machinery\"],\"sourceQuotes\":[{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"do not copy odd_sdlc runtime code, ledgers, phase-flow controller, or local truth surfaces\"}],\"text\":\"Obligation 13, no copied predecessor machinery.\\n\\nRealization:\\n- src/hello.mjs has no import.\\n- The verifiers import only node:test, node:assert/strict and ../../src/hello.mjs.\\n- package.json declares no dependency.\\n\\nVerifier execution:\\n- check-inventory: no-copied-machinery ok for package.json, src/hello.mjs, both verifiers and the plan. None of these contains odd_sdlc, abiogenesis, ledger, registry, controller, scheduler, child_process, node:net or node:http, and src/hello.mjs has no import and no require. root-entries is also ok.\\n- check-verifier-structure: import-set ok for both verifiers.\\n\\nThe documents are exempt from the lexical check. The conformance document carries the ABG-ownership sentence together with its non-authority note. The verification scripts contain those tokens only as literal check data; they read files, spawn nothing and write nothing. In this author's reading they are not runtime, registry, ledger, controller or scheduler machinery.\\n\\nSupported over the snapshot. Independent review of every subject body is outstanding.\"},{\"statementRef\":\"evidence-statement:18-declared-outcome-observation\",\"modality\":\"normative\",\"obligationRefs\":[\"obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/3455007307fe03dfedde9e233996cf076f3fe5da4d0640e62329e00a658bf670\"],\"requirementRefs\":[\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/db07c18d91f1dcee127290132e58619874224e0edc21af9af0b29245818242ff\"],\"predecessorStatementRefs\":[\"requirement-statement:15-declared-outcome-observation\",\"design-statement:08-typed-outcome-observation\"],\"sourceQuotes\":[{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"expectedReturnValue: \\\"Hello, world!\\\"\"},{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"assertedReturnValue must be\"}],\"text\":\"Obligation 14, declared outcome observation.\\n\\nRealization: exactly one module_export_return_exact observation exists: predicate hello-world-return-exact, ordinal 6, in execution observation f3f8fc59….\\n- Declaration: path src/hello.mjs, export helloWorld, equals \\\"Hello, world!\\\".\\n- Observed value: \\\"Hello, world!\\\", as a JSON string.\\n- Evidence coordinate: worksite-observation 94c1ae47…, whose file digest is the constructed src/hello.mjs digest, e62ab9f3….\\n- It was returned with the ordered results of the nine commands, in one ABI worker turn: actor command-execution-worker@5, using the helper worksite_command_helper.js from @abiogenesis/typescript-tenant, with one tool call.\\n- No odd_glc harness, checker or verifier imported the module to produce it, and it was not synthesized from the plan or the declaration.\\n\\nVerifier artifacts: the declared predicate, the plan's assertedReturnValue at c69ed6ca…, and check-plan.\\n\\nVerifier execution: check-plan plan-asserted-return-value ok shows assertedReturnValue equals expectedReturnValue. The observed value equals the declared value, but the selected evidence contains no separate admitted comparison record.\\n\\nGaps:\\n- The record does not carry an explicit observed type or argument list.\\n- The module digest is bound only through the evidence coordinate.\\n- Whether this counts as the ABI-owned F_P typed observation is not classified.\"},{\"statementRef\":\"evidence-statement:19-depth-coverage\",\"modality\":\"speculative\",\"obligationRefs\":[\"obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/41e61751720255f4a6b9c890ac9b248dbd8841700d0b0b7c22b99fb04e41fba0\"],\"requirementRefs\":[\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/88958828d9af4ca553462c38b29d8514f35242708d8a0492cca59db11f457ed0\"],\"predecessorStatementRefs\":[\"requirement-statement:18-depth-coverage\"],\"sourceQuotes\":[{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"when the generated tests add depth coverage\"}],\"text\":\"The source anticipates, without requiring, added depth coverage. None was added:\\n- Each verifier declares exactly one test (check-verifier-structure single-test and verifiers-total-tests are ok).\\n- The planned run reported tests 2.\\n\\nThe allowance for depth coverage therefore stays unexercised. Not pinning a pass-count fragment remains a permitted conservative choice.\"},{\"statementRef\":\"evidence-statement:20-stage-vector-conflict\",\"modality\":\"conflicting\",\"obligationRefs\":[\"obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/b9db7693ff6fc70946aedf347e7b347347e79100ea077c6d87c0f9bf7a7aca09\"],\"requirementRefs\":[\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/9a46a12976a1020d5ab1e12524f47719058ff6b9e5bb78fff621d8f120938321\"],\"predecessorStatementRefs\":[\"requirement-statement:16-stage-vector-conflict\",\"requirement-statement:17-traversal-parity-conflict\",\"design-statement:12-stage-vector-conflict\"],\"sourceQuotes\":[{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"Write only package.json and src/hello.mjs.\"},{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"Do not execute the test in this vector.\"},{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"executeFromPlan: false\"},{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"reproduce traversal shape as typed GTL vectors consumed by ABG startup\"}],\"text\":\"The realized construction and execution do not reproduce the source's stage vector. There was one native construction activation and one command-execution turn, with commands declared literally by the Design. There were no per-turn 'Write only' limits, no 'in this vector' prohibitions, no execution driven by executeFromPlan, and no traversal parity.\\n\\nWriting the plan executed nothing: construction ran no command, and the construction report states that it ran none.\\n\\nStill unruled:\\n- whether any per-turn limit survives\\n- whether the derivation order requires sequential activations\\n- whether traversal parity is owed\\n- what executeFromPlan means\\n\\nThis evidence is not evidence of an identical legacy traversal.\"},{\"statementRef\":\"evidence-statement:21-witness\",\"modality\":\"supporting\",\"obligationRefs\":[],\"requirementRefs\":[],\"predecessorStatementRefs\":[\"requirement-statement:20-witness\"],\"sourceQuotes\":[{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"sourceProject: \\\"odd_sdlc\\\"\"},{\"memberRef\":\"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4\",\"quote\":\"durationMinutes: 41.64\"}],\"text\":\"The witness run (odd_sdlc, 41.64 minutes, an eight-step traversal) remains unverified historical provenance. None of this evidence derives from it or corroborates it.\"},{\"statementRef\":\"evidence-statement:22-role-separation\",\"modality\":\"supporting\",\"obligationRefs\":[],\"requirementRefs\":[],\"predecessorStatementRefs\":[\"requirement-statement:19-proof-role-mapping\",\"design-statement:13-proof-role-mapping\"],\"sourceQuotes\":[],\"text\":\"The four evidence roles stay distinct:\\n- Realization: the constructed bodies. For obligations 10, 11 and 14 it is instead the command record, its per-suite outcomes and the typed observation.\\n- Verifier artifacts: the two test files, the plan, the declared predicates and the six checkers.\\n- Verifier execution: the admitted command runs and the C2 predicate observations over one snapshot.\\n- Semantic assessment: the independent assessor's reading of the actual bodies and the admitted output.\\n\\nFor obligations 7 and 8, the verifier files are the realization and check-verifier-structure is the separate verifier execution.\\n\\nEvery 'supported' finding in this asset is a computation (C): checker output or a predicate observation over bound bodies. This author's readings of stdout and of document faithfulness are judgment (J). They are candidate material only: they neither replace a missing computation (G1, G2) nor admit anything. Acceptance and scope changes are owner rulings (O), outside this stage.\"},{\"statementRef\":\"evidence-statement:23-revision-reconciliation\",\"modality\":\"supporting\",\"obligationRefs\":[],\"requirementRefs\":[],\"predecessorStatementRefs\":[\"design-statement:15-revision-reconciliation\",\"requirement-statement:22-revision-reconciliation\"],\"sourceQuotes\":[],\"text\":\"This Evidence authoring follows a stage revision. Its cause (c-call 4d3a73ad…, result 0cc86f61…) is recorded under reason diagnostic://abiogenesis/implementation/undispatched/preparation/thrown@5, an undispatched preparation failure, and its body is not selected. No obligation or target was selected for revision.\\n\\nThe preserved Intent, Product, Requirements (7a978d3c…) and Design (8bbebc05…) assets are the authority here. The construction and execution records bound above are unchanged. No prior Evidence asset body is selected, so nothing is superseded or carried forward from one.\"},{\"statementRef\":\"evidence-statement:24-stage-claim-boundary\",\"modality\":\"supporting\",\"obligationRefs\":[],\"requirementRefs\":[],\"predecessorStatementRefs\":[\"design-statement:16-stage-claim-boundary\",\"requirement-statement:23-stage-claim-boundary\",\"product-statement:22-stage-claim-boundary\"],\"sourceQuotes\":[],\"text\":\"This asset binds evidence and reports gaps only.\\n\\nConstruction readiness was met: all 14 targets exist at the bound digests.\\n\\nObserved behavior is limited to the recorded run: exit status 0, two passing tests, 'fail 0' in stdout, and helloWorld() returning \\\"Hello, world!\\\".\\n\\nRemaining application obligations:\\n- G1, G2 and G3, at their owners\\n- the ABI readiness classifications\\n- independent semantic assessment of every surface\\n- the owner's acceptance ruling\\n\\nNo obligation is closed. No acceptance, release or application closure is inferred, and application coverage remains non-closing.\"}],\"pressure\":[{\"pressureRef\":\"evidence-pressure:01-g1-stdout-fragment\",\"disposition\":\"pending\",\"requirementRefs\":[\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/88958828d9af4ca553462c38b29d8514f35242708d8a0492cca59db11f457ed0\",\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/31fcd6813562347ff58ee3be2eed9320788c8a8ea87ec9d16a71e1fb994dae55\",\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/d8d166906884606b13f9a636db2c1efd2c9718e4c7984b671b0c92df67d5ebe9\"],\"text\":\"ABI gap G1 still blocks. No admitted predicate compares expectedStdoutMatch ('fail 0') with planned-verifier-run's stdout. The Design declared no such predicate, and the C2 predicate catalog was not inspected here. The admitted stdout visibly contains 'ℹ fail 0', but that reading cannot stand in for the computation.\\n\\nG1 blocks three things:\\n- obligation 9's comparison\\n- obligation 10's planSatisfied derivation\\n- obligation 11's planSatisfied condition\\n\\nClosure needs either an ABI-owned substring or report-bound observation over the same run, or an owner ruling that reprices planSatisfied.\"},{\"pressureRef\":\"evidence-pressure:02-g2-same-run-suite-attribution\",\"disposition\":\"pending\",\"requirementRefs\":[\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/6cec93b453f2df9b331e5908febb36e581998805218c49fab406ce4e9370a287\",\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/2ac1b260a4c172edf2c948ed18390b42302657bec15407901409728e5e2e5ad3\",\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/221df643ebe7e2b283bc56db2ae7e674def6ca0cdc88ba89c7b0e645ea40dd71\",\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/31fcd6813562347ff58ee3be2eed9320788c8a8ea87ec9d16a71e1fb994dae55\",\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/d8d166906884606b13f9a636db2c1efd2c9718e4c7984b671b0c92df67d5ebe9\"],\"text\":\"ABI gap G2 still blocks. The evidence does not attribute each suite's pass within planned-verifier-run by an admitted observation of that suite. All inputs of rule D-suite are observed true, and the stdout names both passing tests. However, the requirement forbids inferring suite passes from an aggregate count.\\n\\nThe separate component-suite-run and uat-suite-run passes are corroboration only.\\n\\nClosure needs either a per-file observation from the ABI owner or an owner ruling that reprices the attribution clause.\"},{\"pressureRef\":\"evidence-pressure:03-g3-construction-basis\",\"disposition\":\"pending\",\"requirementRefs\":[\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/3e9025692e1fd4b454ea40c9695fa2b37c662812a79169a50099d8fd1ab54210\",\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/d3d8ed21b5d15af3a3a3bf1ccd3ff5adf06b9e202ca112bfbbc7195c5d0d54ba\",\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/88958828d9af4ca553462c38b29d8514f35242708d8a0492cca59db11f457ed0\",\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/9a46a12976a1020d5ab1e12524f47719058ff6b9e5bb78fff621d8f120938321\"],\"text\":\"Lifecycle gap G3 remains. A single construction activation (c-call b28cfddc…) wrote every target, so no predecessor digest is in a dependent's admitted construction basis. This affects obligations 5, 6, 9 and 12.\\n\\ncheck-derivation proves only named edges and cross-surface consistency, and the write order is a constructor self-report.\\n\\nClosure needs either staged construction activations, reached through lawful re-entry with predecessors as declared read paths, or an owner ruling that reprices the digest-basis clause.\"},{\"pressureRef\":\"evidence-pressure:04-typed-observation-content-and-admission\",\"disposition\":\"pending\",\"requirementRefs\":[\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/db07c18d91f1dcee127290132e58619874224e0edc21af9af0b29245818242ff\",\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/6cec93b453f2df9b331e5908febb36e581998805218c49fab406ce4e9370a287\"],\"text\":\"The typed observation exists, but three things are still open:\\n- It lacks an explicit observed type and argument list.\\n- It binds the module digest only through its evidence coordinate.\\n- It is unclassified whether it is admitted as the ABI-owned F_P typed observation under REQ-GLC-WORKSITE-LIFECYCLE-013.\\n\\nIt is also unconfirmed whether the evidence model admits the run record and the typed observation in the realization role (req-pressure:23).\"},{\"pressureRef\":\"evidence-pressure:05-verdict-and-evaluator-records\",\"disposition\":\"pending\",\"requirementRefs\":[\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/31fcd6813562347ff58ee3be2eed9320788c8a8ea87ec9d16a71e1fb994dae55\",\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/d8d166906884606b13f9a636db2c1efd2c9718e4c7984b671b0c92df67d5ebe9\",\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/db07c18d91f1dcee127290132e58619874224e0edc21af9af0b29245818242ff\"],\"text\":\"The selected evidence records observed predicate values only. It contains none of the following:\\n- a separate per-predicate verdict\\n- the derivation output that obligation 10 requires, with each derived value\\n- the recorded evaluator result for each of the four conditions that obligation 11 requires\\n- a distinct comparison record for obligation 14\\n\\nThe fact that observed values equal declared values is established here by reading. It is not an admitted verdict.\"},{\"pressureRef\":\"evidence-pressure:06-executed-environment\",\"disposition\":\"unassessed\",\"requirementRefs\":[\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/31fcd6813562347ff58ee3be2eed9320788c8a8ea87ec9d16a71e1fb994dae55\"],\"text\":\"The Design and the executable capability declared environment {}. Every executed command instead carried HOME, LANG=C.UTF-8, LC_ALL=C.UTF-8, PATH and TMPDIR. Whether this runtime-supplied baseline is admitted capability behavior is unassessed. Nothing indicates that it changed subject behavior.\"},{\"pressureRef\":\"evidence-pressure:07-inventory-scope\",\"disposition\":\"pending\",\"requirementRefs\":[\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/206f06fea56b5a9a64d066ed597f7f3f57940ee9838caf0f2a41c2375cc8fa70\",\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/627fab4b7eeee0bed12887d25fca8034acfec37855c7dd4091af9adbe4c3b80b\",\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/bc22ead80214da5fb40b552a5a4045a6b8554f1130fa14c0034f01b8a12c6b47\"],\"text\":\"check-inventory ran in the helper sandbox over the 15-member command snapshot. The live post-construction inventory body (886aa227…) is not selected.\\n\\nIn the live worksite, the absence of extra entries rests on the construction changedPaths and the empty worksiteDelta. That covers obligations 3, 2 and 13, including the root-entries, bin and node_modules checks. The live worksite also holds .abiogenesis and semantic-assets, which are allowed and not subject content.\"},{\"pressureRef\":\"evidence-pressure:08-verifier-and-check-strength\",\"disposition\":\"unassessed\",\"requirementRefs\":[\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/6cec93b453f2df9b331e5908febb36e581998805218c49fab406ce4e9370a287\",\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/2ac1b260a4c172edf2c948ed18390b42302657bec15407901409728e5e2e5ad3\",\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/221df643ebe7e2b283bc56db2ae7e674def6ca0cdc88ba89c7b0e645ea40dd71\",\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/088b36dcb16f9fc6fb6bc9b1bb35f156d0c18d2f29833287e2d9302196d903ea\",\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/3e9025692e1fd4b454ea40c9695fa2b37c662812a79169a50099d8fd1ab54210\",\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/d3d8ed21b5d15af3a3a3bf1ccd3ff5adf06b9e202ca112bfbbc7195c5d0d54ba\"],\"text\":\"Strength limits of the verifiers and checks:\\n- No negative probe was run, so no run shows either verifier failing on a wrong greeting.\\n- The document checks prove presence only. Some needles are weak: 'source' is also matched by 'component test source', and 'private' and 'module' are generic words.\\n- Faithfulness of the three documents rests on independent semantic assessment.\"},{\"pressureRef\":\"evidence-pressure:09-abi-readiness-classification\",\"disposition\":\"unassessed\",\"requirementRefs\":[\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/31fcd6813562347ff58ee3be2eed9320788c8a8ea87ec9d16a71e1fb994dae55\",\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/d8d166906884606b13f9a636db2c1efd2c9718e4c7984b671b0c92df67d5ebe9\",\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/db07c18d91f1dcee127290132e58619874224e0edc21af9af0b29245818242ff\"],\"text\":\"The observed facts are:\\n- test_pass_count parsed Node 24.7.0 spec-reporter output and recorded 2, 1 and 1.\\n- module_export_return_exact returned a value.\\n- Per-command results were recorded.\\n\\nREQ-GLC-ABG-REQUIREMENTS-ALGEBRA-CONSUMPTION-001/013 require each consumed capability to be classified as ready, missing, placeholder, test_only, unwired or unpinned. That classification is not recorded, and this stage does not make it. Observations of behavior in this run are not a readiness ruling.\"},{\"pressureRef\":\"evidence-pressure:10-stale-requirements-asset\",\"disposition\":\"pending\",\"requirementRefs\":[],\"text\":\"The construction report states that semantic-assets/stage-2.json on disk is still the falsified Requirements candidate cef9896f, not the admitted asset 7a978d3c. This evidence uses the admitted asset. Correcting the materialization belongs to the runtime or lifecycle owner.\"},{\"pressureRef\":\"evidence-pressure:11-carried-owner-rulings\",\"disposition\":\"conflicting\",\"requirementRefs\":[\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/9a46a12976a1020d5ab1e12524f47719058ff6b9e5bb78fff621d8f120938321\",\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/bc22ead80214da5fb40b552a5a4045a6b8554f1130fa14c0034f01b8a12c6b47\",\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/d8d166906884606b13f9a636db2c1efd2c9718e4c7984b671b0c92df67d5ebe9\",\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/db07c18d91f1dcee127290132e58619874224e0edc21af9af0b29245818242ff\",\"requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/6cec93b453f2df9b331e5908febb36e581998805218c49fab406ce4e9370a287\"],\"text\":\"These questions still need an owner ruling, and this evidence decides none of them:\\n- per-turn limits and sequencing\\n- traversal parity\\n- artifact summaries versus artifact bodies\\n- the definition of planSatisfied\\n- whether assertedReturnValue is a separate predicate\\n- the direct-return reading\\n- the UAT distinction\\n- acceptor identity\\n- the conformance ownership vocabulary\\n- the meaning of executeFromPlan\\n- the unverified witness\"},{\"pressureRef\":\"evidence-pressure:12-assessment-and-acceptance-outstanding\",\"disposition\":\"pending\",\"requirementRefs\":[],\"text\":\"Still outstanding:\\n- independent semantic assessment of every bound body and of the admitted output\\n- the owner's acceptance ruling\\n\\nThe acceptance edge stays blocked by G1 and G2, and application coverage remains non-closing.\"}]},\"bindings\":[],\"design\":null}","structured_output":{"kind":"semantic_job_asset_candidate","schemaVersion":"5.0.0","asset":{"kind":"semantic_stage_asset_candidate","schemaVersion":"5.0.0","requirementCandidates":[],"worksiteDesign":null,"statements":[{"statementRef":"evidence-statement:01-evidence-basis","modality":"supporting","obligationRefs":[],"requirementRefs":[],"predecessorStatementRefs":["design-statement:14-dependencies-and-readiness","design-statement:06-native-execution","requirement-statement:21-source-role"],"sourceQuotes":[],"text":"This asset binds one construction record and one command-execution record, both selected as admitted execution evidence.\n\nConstruction:\n- native-work-observation://abiogenesis/b17961c3865b64b65275692cd892ea5fb59e9c7fbe9ef14335e751b903c06479\n- result result://abiogenesis/e14ee1f3df7ac6292eba353ccf7b9cb000c5c25d4f49e0d997577b22ea61bb36\n- c-call b28cfddc…; disposition admitted; judgment advance\n- One activation wrote all 14 targets. changedPaths lists exactly the eight subject surfaces, the six verification scripts and their directories.\n\nExecution:\n- worksite-command-execution-observation://abiogenesis/f3f8fc59b60766b8deea3c9c0e119bceb2f11ab5ac09b8a699dfc6d500c1cb85\n- execution result result://abiogenesis/5f743236d9c21a82eb4da9d1fff8590403ae087db386f1a32d7d6c39b46ac8f5\n- task 3f90ed65…\n- actor actor://abiogenesis/worksite/command-execution-worker@5, lane worker_executes, one tool call\n- snapshot worksite-command-snapshot://abiogenesis/4c4a716cd9fc11040acaea35f185bbb16f3631a3e1e88760dfc9d23e3ce983b7\n- Its sourceNativeWork is the same construction observation, b17961c3….\n\nThe identities agree:\n- All 15 snapshot members carry the same file digest as the artifact bodies presented here, and each names that body's construction-time worksite observation. The 15 members are the 14 targets plus the job-source copy (sha256:c799b9e4…, 6120 bytes).\n- Construction and execution share workspace binding 3f9a41f2… and authority basis c2f9961f….\n- All nine commands and all 13 predicate observations therefore ran over exactly the bodies bound in this asset.\n- worksiteDelta and productDelta are both empty, so execution changed no subject file.\n\nI found no wrong identity in these links. These records establish the recorded execution only. They do not show current physical state, and a later edit to any bound surface makes the affected evidence stale."},{"statementRef":"evidence-statement:02-command-record","modality":"supporting","obligationRefs":[],"requirementRefs":[],"predecessorStatementRefs":["design-statement:06-native-execution"],"sourceQuotes":[],"text":"Command record. All nine commands ran with the same settings:\n- executable /opt/homebrew/Cellar/node/24.7.0/bin/node\n- relativeCwd \".\"\n- no expected reports\n- exit status 0, no process signal, not timed out, termination confirmed\n- empty stderr: 0 bytes, sha256:e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855\n\nWorksite-command-observation refs:\n- planned-verifier-run, args [\"--test\", \"test/component/hello.test.mjs\", \"test/uat/hello.uat.test.mjs\"], timeout 30000 ms: 16ae72256f5551f7cfd2fc80f7822c98b3cec23541f13ceb0bca82d4d32c4160. Stdout 266 bytes, sha256:6f9ba47c6bf8b8a1c69878fd62f4214ae8f8cfec6f8db33ce2e7885343b021ec.\n- component-suite-run, args [\"--test\", \"test/component/hello.test.mjs\"], timeout 30000 ms: f1e7c2a36d7f9177b7db4b6fe9f1fbe22388835e06b29dd55305d24244ad6642. Stdout 187 bytes, sha256:9efd9b851d1349a37e36d9f4c14acd07d3a11f934040085dcc50fdbd09e07df4.\n- uat-suite-run, args [\"--test\", \"test/uat/hello.uat.test.mjs\"], timeout 30000 ms: ffc9477fdc764606f37e25d0896949a2ca9dd074f33ef696fe901c15475aa9b1. Stdout 198 bytes, sha256:53c70c5ec032980d93f1500dadf7d115607530361f6c2bee1a1d114f87cc026d.\n- Six checkers, each with timeout 15000 ms:\n  - check-inventory 095ac79b7807f91012ea0719f31e6a0abafb09eb39830812c575c0708a80c7d9: 20 checks, 0 failures\n  - check-package d278437d134b53c630d5c433c9f70b0a03f3099987e3780a8b8f0dd0d30c490b: 4 checks, 0 failures\n  - check-documents 462e629bd590e7ad0a9327c29b7fa6e00d7392ae423db7bdf7c774f8fda809f9: 24 checks, 0 failures\n  - check-verifier-structure 809b0ea238de96179809e85d6cb9581503cfbe55ad7ff7857c170e85528eeec3: 24 checks, 0 failures\n  - check-plan 6e50483ff7d581cdde55119679b88c21ff68ab6de634898339fe15b687edfa21: 11 checks, 0 failures\n  - check-derivation 7ce5daf2c74a9cb3f8971e252abd8d12fadb508e06fc7503d83d0a57acb37ea5: 10 checks, 0 failures\n\nThe same record holds 13 predicate observations:\n- process_exit observed 0 for all nine commands\n- test_pass_count observed 2 for planned-verifier-run, and 1 for each suite run\n- module_export_return_exact observed \"Hello, world!\"\n\nThe record carries observed values only. The selected evidence contains no separate per-predicate verdict and no per-condition evaluator record.\n\nThe executed commands carried HOME, LANG=C.UTF-8, LC_ALL=C.UTF-8, PATH and TMPDIR, although the Design and the capability declared environment {}. Both points are carried as pressure."},{"statementRef":"evidence-statement:03-runner-output-reading","modality":"supporting","obligationRefs":["obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/41e61751720255f4a6b9c890ac9b248dbd8841700d0b0b7c22b99fb04e41fba0","obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/87511aff478a1e4700ba794c4bd0449e66ba1c22bf8a6aa69d736ae0eb862d69","obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/ef532097a24726244bf79cc637e15990ea8dcdd8740453dea9d74b89645d5fe3"],"requirementRefs":["requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/88958828d9af4ca553462c38b29d8514f35242708d8a0492cca59db11f457ed0","requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/31fcd6813562347ff58ee3be2eed9320788c8a8ea87ec9d16a71e1fb994dae55","requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/d8d166906884606b13f9a636db2c1efd2c9718e4c7984b671b0c92df67d5ebe9"],"predecessorStatementRefs":["design-statement:07-acceptance-computation"],"sourceQuotes":[{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"expectedStdoutMatch must include stable zero-failure evidence such as fail 0"}],"text":"Planned-run stdout, verbatim (sha256:6f9ba47c…):\n\n✔ component: helloWorld() returns exactly 'Hello, world!' (0.28ms)\n✔ uat: the user-visible greeting contract is exactly 'Hello, world!' (0.27825ms)\nℹ tests 2\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 2\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 35.576875\n\nEach suite run shows one ✔ line with the matching name prefix, followed by 'ℹ tests 1', 'ℹ pass 1' and 'ℹ fail 0'. Under this capture Node 24.7.0 used the spec reporter, not TAP. The test_pass_count parser handled this output: its recorded values 2, 1 and 1 agree with the 'ℹ pass' lines.\n\nThese stdout readings are this author's judgment (J), not admitted computations. They do not close G1 or G2."},{"statementRef":"evidence-statement:04-greeting-return-value","modality":"normative","obligationRefs":["obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/b0d4821ca26232eeb993447f56e6af622e2b392cd82a274e9005ad742d88ac1a"],"requirementRefs":["requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/6cec93b453f2df9b331e5908febb36e581998805218c49fab406ce4e9370a287"],"predecessorStatementRefs":["requirement-statement:01-greeting-return-value","design-statement:02-implementation-realization","design-statement:04-verifiers"],"sourceQuotes":[{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"src/hello.mjs must export helloWorld() returning exactly"},{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"expectedReturnValue: \"Hello, world!\""},{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"Assert helloWorld() returns exactly"}],"text":"Obligation 0, greeting return value.\n\nRealization: src/hello.mjs (worksite-observation 94c1ae47…, 108 bytes) is exactly:\n// Derived from design/implementation-design.md.\nexport function helloWorld() {\n  return \"Hello, world!\";\n}\nhelloWorld is a synchronous named export that returns the literal directly. The module has no import, no default export, and no console or process use.\n\nVerifier artifacts: both test files. Each has the exact import and assert.strictEqual(helloWorld(), \"Hello, world!\").\n\nVerifier execution:\n- planned-verifier-run exited 0 with empty stderr.\n- planned-run-exit-zero observed 0; planned-run-pass-floor observed 2.\n- The typed observation hello-world-return-exact observed \"Hello, world!\" against the same module observation 94c1ae47… (see obligation 14).\n\nSemantic assessment: the independent assessment is still outstanding. This author's reading finds that the body and assertions match the source and the Design.\n\nSupported: helloWorld() returned the literal in the recorded execution.\nNot yet shown by an admitted computation: separate component and UAT passes inside the planned run (G2).\nUnconstrained and unproved: behavior with arguments, other exports and side effects. No run shows a verifier failing on a wrong greeting."},{"statementRef":"evidence-statement:05-package-manifest","modality":"normative","obligationRefs":["obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/8db452e0e1bbc88e188c860d05a9a00b190c4c8efaac86d1867545807141dd0f"],"requirementRefs":["requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/4b0d0a5472f2dbc0912370d9aa5ecc33c0ebc755c95186c390e96f73c97b077d"],"predecessorStatementRefs":["requirement-statement:02-package-manifest","design-statement:02-implementation-realization"],"sourceQuotes":[{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"package.json must be private:true and type:module."}],"text":"Obligation 1, package manifest.\n\nRealization: package.json (worksite-observation 148ef636…, 42 bytes) is exactly {\"private\": true, \"type\": \"module\"}, with no other key.\n\nVerifier artifact: verification/check-package.mjs, which is read-only.\n\nVerifier execution:\n- check-package exited 0.\n- Its stdout printed 'digest package.json sha256:609158e6…' and ok for package-parses, private-true, type-module and keys-exact.\n- check-package-exit-zero observed 0.\n\nSupported: private === true and type === \"module\" in the bound body. The planned node --test run is not evidence for these fields: .mjs files load as ES modules regardless of type, and private has no runtime effect. Independent semantic assessment is outstanding."},{"statementRef":"evidence-statement:06-return-value-only-surface","modality":"normative","obligationRefs":["obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/7a8b5b917def2cca68739c356b11768944ef192b5c4466b73b395e574e4d2c32"],"requirementRefs":["requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/627fab4b7eeee0bed12887d25fca8034acfec37855c7dd4091af9adbe4c3b80b"],"predecessorStatementRefs":["requirement-statement:03-return-value-only-surface","product-statement:03-no-program-output"],"sourceQuotes":[{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"expectedStdout: null"}],"text":"Obligation 2, return value as the only greeting surface.\n\nRealization:\n- package.json has no bin, scripts, main, exports or dependencies.\n- src/hello.mjs has no console or process use.\n- Both verifiers assert the return value, not stdout.\n\nVerifier artifacts: check-inventory, check-package and check-verifier-structure.\n\nVerifier execution (all three exited 0):\n- check-package: keys-exact ok.\n- check-verifier-structure: component-no-doubles-or-output and uat-no-doubles-or-output ok.\n- check-inventory: root-entries ok (no node_modules, no bin, no note lines) and no-authored-result ok.\n\nIn runner stdout the greeting appears only inside test names. That is verifier output, not subject output.\n\nSupported over the command snapshot. For the live post-construction worksite, absence rests on the construction changedPaths and the empty worksiteDelta, because the after-construction inventory body is not selected. Whether importing the module writes any output is neither required nor proved."},{"statementRef":"evidence-statement:07-governed-surface-set","modality":"normative","obligationRefs":["obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/5424a144e7721982c9b4dd6c6a7511e0707e85f2fb11fa5f192774000623378f"],"requirementRefs":["requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/206f06fea56b5a9a64d066ed597f7f3f57940ee9838caf0f2a41c2375cc8fa70"],"predecessorStatementRefs":["requirement-statement:04-governed-surface-set","design-statement:01-subject-topology"],"sourceQuotes":[{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"Name package.json, src/hello.mjs, design/test-design.md, test/component/hello.test.mjs, test/uat/hello.uat.test.mjs, test-execution-plan.json, and execution result as separate lifecycle surfaces."},{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"Produce no files."}],"text":"Obligation 3, governed surface set.\n\nThe eight surfaces exist as separate files at the source-given paths. Each is bound to its construction-time worksite observation and its snapshot member:\n- specification/project-conformance.md: sha256:148e9bb1fd6dd2c39121e3e141e8a46b22cae5912e670cc04f3a2b0ec7799a3a, 1182 bytes\n- design/implementation-design.md: sha256:2a5acf0f055983bf757cf1324669be609ddedddb753db03e4e2897e6fc370ee3, 946 bytes\n- package.json: sha256:609158e6c5fbc237939fa3ddf7faab80ab690bdc0c8d584414a885130103c4e8, 42 bytes\n- src/hello.mjs: sha256:e62ab9f36107d91297bcb4433418a4a1911d2081724ea141bc848d1d8acde924, 108 bytes\n- design/test-design.md: sha256:17fcb06fcf2253a475b296772b8a15569522be2632b9c398c63181d56bef90df, 1104 bytes\n- test/component/hello.test.mjs: sha256:4eefc99756ee34640b1e2c8baecb9ff4fa199d8d014d6ed935fe5bec7a9f031b, 312 bytes\n- test/uat/hello.uat.test.mjs: sha256:42bf7e724edf073aeb23f0e9b1d5dabf66a63ce444c51c3502303fd9d3332e82, 354 bytes\n- test-execution-plan.json: sha256:c69ed6ca8f50ba55e59ff4a841856cb977a63ebdf6d2c98b81e35ba62af4ed7d, 300 bytes\n\nThe design-selected verifier artifacts are separate files:\n- verification/check-inventory.mjs: sha256:327d0fdb5a67ddf7e3a4b6eee6d770a7f4f57402423abebb5ce75df18c2a517\n- check-package.mjs: sha256:ef9d65362094704dd1a8927e2abf4ac99e8660ffb650793b7b7843b4dba1552a\n- check-documents.mjs: sha256:21537559351303205f7264f78b6c400059057cc85a1d323c99c18029356218dd\n- check-verifier-structure.mjs: sha256:59296f62425a051fab2ed5e6e9de942921da5165faab9c5fc68d1f54c090fbc7\n- check-plan.mjs: sha256:dadf87cd9c1b7e410451c74ece70574a31966098a3954b53949da9b3e5bbd746\n- check-derivation.mjs: sha256:491e7edbefd97b322fe6bd514c147d7448b6c2ef0e7fee94c5b2c1d260059668\n\nThe job-source copy is the only other snapshot member.\n\nVerifier execution: check-inventory exited 0 with 20 checks and 0 failures.\n- surface ok for all eight paths\n- exact-set ok for specification, design, src, test and verification\n- no-authored-result ok\n- root-entries ok\n- The digests it printed equal the list above.\n\nNo execution-result file was authored. The result exists only as the command record (obligation 10). Presence alone proves no content requirement; content is bound under obligations 0 to 9."},{"statementRef":"evidence-statement:08-conformance-document","modality":"normative","obligationRefs":["obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/8192562fedfdf16555663296ac3d61c1d3361b2dd9e50bb50d98ffd26f4cd843"],"requirementRefs":["requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/088b36dcb16f9fc6fb6bc9b1bb35f156d0c18d2f29833287e2d9302196d903ea"],"predecessorStatementRefs":["requirement-statement:05-conformance-document","design-statement:03-governing-documents"],"sourceQuotes":[{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"Declare the project pressure for a JavaScript Hello World software build traversal."},{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"Name the required downstream lifecycle surfaces: implementation design, source, test design, component test source, UAT test source, test execution plan, and test execution result."},{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"State that ABG owns startup admission, registry selection, graph-call opening, vector traversal, F_P dispatch, evidence admission, event emission, closure, and convergence."}],"text":"Obligation 4, conformance document.\n\nRealization: specification/project-conformance.md (worksite-observation 50d205db…) contains:\n- the sentence 'This project declares the project pressure for a JavaScript Hello World software build traversal.'\n- a section 'Required downstream lifecycle surfaces' with seven bullets: implementation design, source, test design, component test source, UAT test source, test execution plan, test execution result\n- the ABG-ownership sentence verbatim, followed by a note that it describes the building environment, grants no authority, and places no runtime, registry, ledger, controller, scheduler or traversal machinery in the subject\n- 'This document is the authority for design/implementation-design.md.'\n\nIt also restates two points: the only public behavior is a return value with no stdout, CLI, HTTP, UI or deployment surface, and the execution result has no authored file. This added text is consistent with the source and the requirements and does not widen scope.\n\nVerifier execution: check-documents exited 0 and printed digest sha256:148e9bb1…. All of these printed ok:\n- conformance-pressure\n- the seven conformance-surface checks\n- conformance-ownership (exact match)\n- conformance-authority-for-design\n\nSupported: every required element is present. Faithfulness and sufficiency await independent assessment.\n\nThe 'source' surface check is vacuous as a substring test, because it also matches 'component test source'. The body does list source as its own bullet. Whether the predecessor ABG vocabulary matches the current native lifecycle is unassessed."},{"statementRef":"evidence-statement:09-implementation-design-document","modality":"normative","obligationRefs":["obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/7010ec2a96c88bd2d24ad996e6886455f71045c20bfdec4344e35e3867f4b681"],"requirementRefs":["requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/3e9025692e1fd4b454ea40c9695fa2b37c662812a79169a50099d8fd1ab54210"],"predecessorStatementRefs":["requirement-statement:06-implementation-design-document","design-statement:03-governing-documents","design-statement:10-derivation-direction"],"sourceQuotes":[{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"Use the prior conformance_project artifact as the authority."},{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"Define a minimal JavaScript module that exports helloWorld() returning exactly"}],"text":"Obligation 5, implementation design.\n\nRealization: design/implementation-design.md (worksite-observation 34b858a6…) contains:\n- 'Authority: specification/project-conformance.md', and a sentence deriving the document from it\n- the minimal module: a named, synchronous helloWorld() that returns exactly \"Hello, world!\" directly, with no imports, no default export and no output\n- package.json as exactly \"private\": true and \"type\": \"module\", with no other field\n- the separate surfaces package.json, src/hello.mjs, design/test-design.md, test/component/hello.test.mjs, test/uat/hello.uat.test.mjs, test-execution-plan.json and execution result\n- a statement that the execution result has no file and is realized only by admitted native execution\n\nVerifier execution:\n- check-documents: design-authority, design-module, the seven design-surface checks and design-package-fields all ok\n- check-derivation: edge-conformance-design ok\n\nSupported: the required content and the named authority edge are present.\n\nGap G3: the conformance digest is not in this document's admitted construction basis. check-derivation printed 'note construction-basis-not-admitted edge-conformance-design'."},{"statementRef":"evidence-statement:10-test-design-document","modality":"normative","obligationRefs":["obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/6c446dc68415a8717adac85c42a0f98efb3bbcc66e8011538333346f232334df"],"requirementRefs":["requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/d3d8ed21b5d15af3a3a3bf1ccd3ff5adf06b9e202ca112bfbbc7195c5d0d54ba"],"predecessorStatementRefs":["requirement-statement:07-test-design-document","design-statement:03-governing-documents"],"sourceQuotes":[{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"Specify both component and UAT validation obligations."},{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"The UAT test must validate the user-visible greeting contract through the same exported function."},{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"Use the prior source artifact summaries as the evidence source."}],"text":"Obligation 6, test design.\n\nRealization: design/test-design.md (worksite-observation 17c2fd58…) contains:\n- 'Evidence source: package.json and src/hello.mjs', with the package and export facts\n- the component obligation: import helloWorld from src/hello.mjs and assert by strict equality that the result is exactly \"Hello, world!\"\n- the UAT obligation: validate the user-visible greeting contract through the same exported function, for a JavaScript consumer that imports and calls helloWorld\n- shared constraints: node:test and node:assert/strict; one test() per file; 'component:' and 'uat:' name prefixes; no skip, todo, only, describe or it; no stdout or CLI\n\nVerifier execution:\n- check-documents: test-design-evidence-source, test-design-component, test-design-uat and test-design-libraries all ok\n- check-derivation: edge-source-test-design ok\n\nSupported: both obligations are present and consistent with the bound src/hello.mjs.\n\nGap G3: the package.json and src/hello.mjs digests are not in this document's construction basis. Whether artifact summaries or artifact bodies are the evidence source remains unruled."},{"statementRef":"evidence-statement:11-component-verifier","modality":"normative","obligationRefs":["obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/4aa9ffafc520b40c7d18e7b1d37d231d8a7c806bb60cd7dfd18678193503506d"],"requirementRefs":["requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/2ac1b260a4c172edf2c948ed18390b42302657bec15407901409728e5e2e5ad3"],"predecessorStatementRefs":["requirement-statement:08-component-verifier","design-statement:04-verifiers","design-statement:13-proof-role-mapping"],"sourceQuotes":[{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"Assert helloWorld() returns exactly"},{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"Use the prior test_design and source artifact summaries as the evidence source."}],"text":"Obligation 7, component verifier.\n\nRealization: test/component/hello.test.mjs (worksite-observation 9e55d76e…). The file is itself the realization here and is tagged verifier by path. It contains:\n- the derivation comment naming design/test-design.md and src/hello.mjs\n- import { test } from \"node:test\"; import assert from \"node:assert/strict\"; import { helloWorld } from \"../../src/hello.mjs\"\n- one test, test(\"component: helloWorld() returns exactly 'Hello, world!'\"), containing assert.strictEqual(helloWorld(), \"Hello, world!\")\n\nVerifier artifact: check-verifier-structure.mjs.\n\nVerifier execution:\n- check-verifier-structure exited 0 and printed digest sha256:4eefc997….\n- All eleven component checks printed ok: node-test, assert-strict, exact-import, import-set, resolves-to-subject, strict-assertion, name-prefix, single-test, no-other-test-forms, no-skip-or-focus, no-doubles-or-output.\n- component-suite-run exited 0, with test_pass_count 1.\n\nSupported: the file meets its structural requirement and passes when run alone.\n\nInside planned-verifier-run, the stdout names the passing 'component:' test, but no admitted predicate attributes that pass to this file (G2)."},{"statementRef":"evidence-statement:12-uat-verifier","modality":"normative","obligationRefs":["obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/0b94d7680d5b9fe54ac5f469ca8a369ed85751db38a4561f5a088d7500443d78"],"requirementRefs":["requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/221df643ebe7e2b283bc56db2ae7e674def6ca0cdc88ba89c7b0e645ea40dd71"],"predecessorStatementRefs":["requirement-statement:09-uat-verifier","design-statement:04-verifiers","design-statement:13-proof-role-mapping"],"sourceQuotes":[{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"Assert the user-visible greeting contract is exactly"},{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"Use the prior component_test_source, test_design, and source artifact summaries as the evidence source."}],"text":"Obligation 8, UAT verifier.\n\nRealization: test/uat/hello.uat.test.mjs (worksite-observation a2a556db…). The file is itself the realization here and is tagged verifier by path. It contains:\n- a derivation comment naming test/component/hello.test.mjs, design/test-design.md and src/hello.mjs\n- the same three exact imports as the component verifier\n- one test, test(\"uat: the user-visible greeting contract is exactly 'Hello, world!'\"), containing assert.strictEqual(helloWorld(), \"Hello, world!\")\n\nVerifier execution:\n- check-verifier-structure printed digest sha256:42bf7e72… and ok for all eleven uat checks.\n- verifiers-distinct and verifiers-total-tests printed ok.\n- uat-suite-run exited 0, with test_pass_count 1.\n\nSupported: the file meets its structural requirement and passes when run alone. It invents no CLI or stdout surface, and differs from the component file only in role, file, test name and comment.\n\nAttribution of this file's pass inside the planned run is not computed by an admitted predicate (G2)."},{"statementRef":"evidence-statement:13-execution-plan","modality":"normative","obligationRefs":["obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/41e61751720255f4a6b9c890ac9b248dbd8841700d0b0b7c22b99fb04e41fba0"],"requirementRefs":["requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/88958828d9af4ca553462c38b29d8514f35242708d8a0492cca59db11f457ed0"],"predecessorStatementRefs":["requirement-statement:10-execution-plan","design-statement:05-execution-plan"],"sourceQuotes":[{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"The command must be node with args"},{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"expectedTestPassCount must be at least 2, matching the admitted component and UAT coverage floor."},{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"expectedStdoutMatch must include stable zero-failure evidence such as fail 0"},{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"assertedReturnValue must be"},{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"Use the prior component_test_source and uat_test_source artifact summaries as the evidence source."}],"text":"Obligation 9, execution plan.\n\nRealization: test-execution-plan.json (worksite-observation d3135ed3…) declares:\n- command \"node\"\n- args [\"--test\", \"test/component/hello.test.mjs\", \"test/uat/hello.uat.test.mjs\"]\n- expectedTestPassCount 2\n- expectedStdoutMatch \"fail 0\"\n- assertedReturnValue \"Hello, world!\"\n- derivedFrom, naming both verifiers\nIt has no observed-result field.\n\nVerifier execution:\n- check-plan exited 0 and printed ok for all eleven checks, together with the digests of the plan and both verifiers.\n- check-derivation: edge-verifiers-plan ok.\n- planned-verifier-run used exactly the plan's args with the admitted node executable, over the plan at sha256:c69ed6ca….\n\nSupported: every declared value is present and agrees with the verifiers.\n\nNot computed: the comparison of expectedStdoutMatch with the planned run's stdout (G1). The admitted spec-reporter stdout visibly contains 'ℹ fail 0', but that is a reading, not a computation.\n\nGap G3: the verifier digests are not in the plan's construction basis."},{"statementRef":"evidence-statement:14-observed-execution-result","modality":"normative","obligationRefs":["obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/87511aff478a1e4700ba794c4bd0449e66ba1c22bf8a6aa69d736ae0eb862d69"],"requirementRefs":["requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/31fcd6813562347ff58ee3be2eed9320788c8a8ea87ec9d16a71e1fb994dae55"],"predecessorStatementRefs":["requirement-statement:11-observed-execution-result","design-statement:06-native-execution","design-statement:07-acceptance-computation"],"sourceQuotes":[{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"Produce no files."},{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"Judge the observed executionStatus, planSatisfied flag, observedTestPassCount, and stdout digest against the prior test_execution_plan."}],"text":"Obligation 10, observed execution result.\n\nRealization: the planned-verifier-run record, 16ae7225…, within execution result 5f743236…. It carries:\n- command, args and working directory\n- exit status 0\n- stdout and stderr, with digests\n- run identity: execution observation f3f8fc59…, actor invocation beed8878…\n- consumed surface digests: the members of snapshot 4c4a716c…, which equal the constructed bodies\n\nNo authored result file exists: check-inventory no-authored-result is ok and worksiteDelta is empty.\n\nVerifier artifacts: the plan, at the consumed digest c69ed6ca…, and the declared predicates.\n\nVerifier execution (C2):\n- executionStatus comes from planned-run-exit-zero, observed 0.\n- observedTestPassCount comes from planned-run-pass-floor, observed 2.\n- The stdout digest is sha256:6f9ba47c…, taken from the record.\n\nNo admitted computation derives the per-suite results inside this run (G2) or planSatisfied (G1). The derivation of the result fields is therefore incomplete. This is a recorded ABI gap, not a subject defect."},{"statementRef":"evidence-statement:15-acceptance-predicate","modality":"normative","obligationRefs":["obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/ef532097a24726244bf79cc637e15990ea8dcdd8740453dea9d74b89645d5fe3"],"requirementRefs":["requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/d8d166906884606b13f9a636db2c1efd2c9718e4c7984b671b0c92df67d5ebe9"],"predecessorStatementRefs":["requirement-statement:12-acceptance-predicate","design-statement:07-acceptance-computation","product-statement:14-acceptance-predicate"],"sourceQuotes":[{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"Accept only if both component and UAT tests passed, planSatisfied is true, and observedTestPassCount is at least the prior test_execution_plan expectedTestPassCount."},{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"Do not reject solely because node:test uses a different TAP prefix glyph when the F_D pass-count check is satisfied."}],"text":"Obligation 11, acceptance predicate, evaluated over planned-verifier-run.\n\n1. observedTestPassCount at least expectedTestPassCount: holds by computation. The observed count is 2 and the plan requires 2. check-plan plan-pass-floor-matches-predicate shows the predicate literal equals the plan value.\n\n2. Component passed, and 3. UAT passed: not established by an admitted observation of each suite. Every input of rule D-suite is observed true:\n   - exit status 0 and pass count 2\n   - check-plan plan-args ok\n   - check-verifier-structure single-test ok for both files, verifiers-total-tests ok, and 'note suite-attribution-basis component=1 uat=1'\n   The stdout also shows ✔ lines for both named tests, and each separate suite run passed. However, the requirement forbids inferring suite passes from an aggregate count, so G2 still blocks.\n\n4. planSatisfied: every clause that can be computed holds. The command and args equal the plan, exit status is 0, the floor holds, check-plan shows assertedReturnValue equals expectedReturnValue, and the typed observation equals the declared value. The clause requiring the fragment to occur in stdout has no admitted computation (G1).\n\nThe TAP-glyph tolerance is not needed: the run used the spec reporter and no failure was observed, so the tolerance excuses nothing.\n\nNo per-condition evaluator record exists. The acceptance predicate is not established. Acceptance is an owner ruling, and the source names no acceptor. Nothing in this asset accepts the result."},{"statementRef":"evidence-statement:16-derivation-dependency","modality":"normative","obligationRefs":["obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/b9db7693ff6fc70946aedf347e7b347347e79100ea077c6d87c0f9bf7a7aca09"],"requirementRefs":["requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/9a46a12976a1020d5ab1e12524f47719058ff6b9e5bb78fff621d8f120938321"],"predecessorStatementRefs":["requirement-statement:13-derivation-dependency","design-statement:10-derivation-direction"],"sourceQuotes":[{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"Use the prior conformance_project artifact as the authority."},{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"Use the prior implementation_design artifact as the authority."},{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"Use the prior test_design and source artifact summaries as the evidence source."}],"text":"Obligation 12, derivation dependency.\n\nRealization: each dependent names its predecessor.\n- The implementation design cites the conformance document.\n- src/hello.mjs names the implementation design.\n- The test design names package.json and src/hello.mjs as its evidence source.\n- The component verifier names the test design and src/hello.mjs.\n- The UAT verifier names the component verifier, the test design and src/hello.mjs.\n- The plan's derivedFrom names both verifiers and equals args.slice(1).\n\nVerifier execution: check-derivation exited 0.\n- Six edge checks and four fact checks printed ok. The fact checks cover function name, return value, module path and verifier paths.\n- The digests it printed for all eight surfaces equal the constructed bodies.\n- It printed 'note construction-basis-not-admitted' for each edge, and 'note derivation-order-not-observable'.\n\nSupported: the edges are named in the source's direction, and the surfaces are consistent with each other.\n\nUnproved (G3): one construction activation wrote all 14 targets, so no predecessor digest is in a dependent's admitted construction basis. The constructor's report that it wrote the files in source order is a self-report, not an observation."},{"statementRef":"evidence-statement:17-no-copied-machinery","modality":"normative","obligationRefs":["obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/999a34a746108698bce32c4926643d0d2cb6bb18aed1e6337025d7ad03d346c3"],"requirementRefs":["requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/bc22ead80214da5fb40b552a5a4045a6b8554f1130fa14c0034f01b8a12c6b47"],"predecessorStatementRefs":["requirement-statement:14-no-copied-predecessor-machinery","design-statement:11-no-copied-machinery"],"sourceQuotes":[{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"do not copy odd_sdlc runtime code, ledgers, phase-flow controller, or local truth surfaces"}],"text":"Obligation 13, no copied predecessor machinery.\n\nRealization:\n- src/hello.mjs has no import.\n- The verifiers import only node:test, node:assert/strict and ../../src/hello.mjs.\n- package.json declares no dependency.\n\nVerifier execution:\n- check-inventory: no-copied-machinery ok for package.json, src/hello.mjs, both verifiers and the plan. None of these contains odd_sdlc, abiogenesis, ledger, registry, controller, scheduler, child_process, node:net or node:http, and src/hello.mjs has no import and no require. root-entries is also ok.\n- check-verifier-structure: import-set ok for both verifiers.\n\nThe documents are exempt from the lexical check. The conformance document carries the ABG-ownership sentence together with its non-authority note. The verification scripts contain those tokens only as literal check data; they read files, spawn nothing and write nothing. In this author's reading they are not runtime, registry, ledger, controller or scheduler machinery.\n\nSupported over the snapshot. Independent review of every subject body is outstanding."},{"statementRef":"evidence-statement:18-declared-outcome-observation","modality":"normative","obligationRefs":["obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/3455007307fe03dfedde9e233996cf076f3fe5da4d0640e62329e00a658bf670"],"requirementRefs":["requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/db07c18d91f1dcee127290132e58619874224e0edc21af9af0b29245818242ff"],"predecessorStatementRefs":["requirement-statement:15-declared-outcome-observation","design-statement:08-typed-outcome-observation"],"sourceQuotes":[{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"expectedReturnValue: \"Hello, world!\""},{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"assertedReturnValue must be"}],"text":"Obligation 14, declared outcome observation.\n\nRealization: exactly one module_export_return_exact observation exists: predicate hello-world-return-exact, ordinal 6, in execution observation f3f8fc59….\n- Declaration: path src/hello.mjs, export helloWorld, equals \"Hello, world!\".\n- Observed value: \"Hello, world!\", as a JSON string.\n- Evidence coordinate: worksite-observation 94c1ae47…, whose file digest is the constructed src/hello.mjs digest, e62ab9f3….\n- It was returned with the ordered results of the nine commands, in one ABI worker turn: actor command-execution-worker@5, using the helper worksite_command_helper.js from @abiogenesis/typescript-tenant, with one tool call.\n- No odd_glc harness, checker or verifier imported the module to produce it, and it was not synthesized from the plan or the declaration.\n\nVerifier artifacts: the declared predicate, the plan's assertedReturnValue at c69ed6ca…, and check-plan.\n\nVerifier execution: check-plan plan-asserted-return-value ok shows assertedReturnValue equals expectedReturnValue. The observed value equals the declared value, but the selected evidence contains no separate admitted comparison record.\n\nGaps:\n- The record does not carry an explicit observed type or argument list.\n- The module digest is bound only through the evidence coordinate.\n- Whether this counts as the ABI-owned F_P typed observation is not classified."},{"statementRef":"evidence-statement:19-depth-coverage","modality":"speculative","obligationRefs":["obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/41e61751720255f4a6b9c890ac9b248dbd8841700d0b0b7c22b99fb04e41fba0"],"requirementRefs":["requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/88958828d9af4ca553462c38b29d8514f35242708d8a0492cca59db11f457ed0"],"predecessorStatementRefs":["requirement-statement:18-depth-coverage"],"sourceQuotes":[{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"when the generated tests add depth coverage"}],"text":"The source anticipates, without requiring, added depth coverage. None was added:\n- Each verifier declares exactly one test (check-verifier-structure single-test and verifiers-total-tests are ok).\n- The planned run reported tests 2.\n\nThe allowance for depth coverage therefore stays unexercised. Not pinning a pass-count fragment remains a permitted conservative choice."},{"statementRef":"evidence-statement:20-stage-vector-conflict","modality":"conflicting","obligationRefs":["obligation://abiogenesis/semantic-job/b9db7693ff6fc70946aedf347e7b347347e79100ea077c6d87c0f9bf7a7aca09"],"requirementRefs":["requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/9a46a12976a1020d5ab1e12524f47719058ff6b9e5bb78fff621d8f120938321"],"predecessorStatementRefs":["requirement-statement:16-stage-vector-conflict","requirement-statement:17-traversal-parity-conflict","design-statement:12-stage-vector-conflict"],"sourceQuotes":[{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"Write only package.json and src/hello.mjs."},{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"Do not execute the test in this vector."},{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"executeFromPlan: false"},{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"reproduce traversal shape as typed GTL vectors consumed by ABG startup"}],"text":"The realized construction and execution do not reproduce the source's stage vector. There was one native construction activation and one command-execution turn, with commands declared literally by the Design. There were no per-turn 'Write only' limits, no 'in this vector' prohibitions, no execution driven by executeFromPlan, and no traversal parity.\n\nWriting the plan executed nothing: construction ran no command, and the construction report states that it ran none.\n\nStill unruled:\n- whether any per-turn limit survives\n- whether the derivation order requires sequential activations\n- whether traversal parity is owed\n- what executeFromPlan means\n\nThis evidence is not evidence of an identical legacy traversal."},{"statementRef":"evidence-statement:21-witness","modality":"supporting","obligationRefs":[],"requirementRefs":[],"predecessorStatementRefs":["requirement-statement:20-witness"],"sourceQuotes":[{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"sourceProject: \"odd_sdlc\""},{"memberRef":"urn:sha256:c799b9e43d660f3abc3adf0da32baab17a771f1efe20843c4688162b9e62ced4","quote":"durationMinutes: 41.64"}],"text":"The witness run (odd_sdlc, 41.64 minutes, an eight-step traversal) remains unverified historical provenance. None of this evidence derives from it or corroborates it."},{"statementRef":"evidence-statement:22-role-separation","modality":"supporting","obligationRefs":[],"requirementRefs":[],"predecessorStatementRefs":["requirement-statement:19-proof-role-mapping","design-statement:13-proof-role-mapping"],"sourceQuotes":[],"text":"The four evidence roles stay distinct:\n- Realization: the constructed bodies. For obligations 10, 11 and 14 it is instead the command record, its per-suite outcomes and the typed observation.\n- Verifier artifacts: the two test files, the plan, the declared predicates and the six checkers.\n- Verifier execution: the admitted command runs and the C2 predicate observations over one snapshot.\n- Semantic assessment: the independent assessor's reading of the actual bodies and the admitted output.\n\nFor obligations 7 and 8, the verifier files are the realization and check-verifier-structure is the separate verifier execution.\n\nEvery 'supported' finding in this asset is a computation (C): checker output or a predicate observation over bound bodies. This author's readings of stdout and of document faithfulness are judgment (J). They are candidate material only: they neither replace a missing computation (G1, G2) nor admit anything. Acceptance and scope changes are owner rulings (O), outside this stage."},{"statementRef":"evidence-statement:23-revision-reconciliation","modality":"supporting","obligationRefs":[],"requirementRefs":[],"predecessorStatementRefs":["design-statement:15-revision-reconciliation","requirement-statement:22-revision-reconciliation"],"sourceQuotes":[],"text":"This Evidence authoring follows a stage revision. Its cause (c-call 4d3a73ad…, result 0cc86f61…) is recorded under reason diagnostic://abiogenesis/implementation/undispatched/preparation/thrown@5, an undispatched preparation failure, and its body is not selected. No obligation or target was selected for revision.\n\nThe preserved Intent, Product, Requirements (7a978d3c…) and Design (8bbebc05…) assets are the authority here. The construction and execution records bound above are unchanged. No prior Evidence asset body is selected, so nothing is superseded or carried forward from one."},{"statementRef":"evidence-statement:24-stage-claim-boundary","modality":"supporting","obligationRefs":[],"requirementRefs":[],"predecessorStatementRefs":["design-statement:16-stage-claim-boundary","requirement-statement:23-stage-claim-boundary","product-statement:22-stage-claim-boundary"],"sourceQuotes":[],"text":"This asset binds evidence and reports gaps only.\n\nConstruction readiness was met: all 14 targets exist at the bound digests.\n\nObserved behavior is limited to the recorded run: exit status 0, two passing tests, 'fail 0' in stdout, and helloWorld() returning \"Hello, world!\".\n\nRemaining application obligations:\n- G1, G2 and G3, at their owners\n- the ABI readiness classifications\n- independent semantic assessment of every surface\n- the owner's acceptance ruling\n\nNo obligation is closed. No acceptance, release or application closure is inferred, and application coverage remains non-closing."}],"pressure":[{"pressureRef":"evidence-pressure:01-g1-stdout-fragment","disposition":"pending","requirementRefs":["requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/88958828d9af4ca553462c38b29d8514f35242708d8a0492cca59db11f457ed0","requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/31fcd6813562347ff58ee3be2eed9320788c8a8ea87ec9d16a71e1fb994dae55","requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/d8d166906884606b13f9a636db2c1efd2c9718e4c7984b671b0c92df67d5ebe9"],"text":"ABI gap G1 still blocks. No admitted predicate compares expectedStdoutMatch ('fail 0') with planned-verifier-run's stdout. The Design declared no such predicate, and the C2 predicate catalog was not inspected here. The admitted stdout visibly contains 'ℹ fail 0', but that reading cannot stand in for the computation.\n\nG1 blocks three things:\n- obligation 9's comparison\n- obligation 10's planSatisfied derivation\n- obligation 11's planSatisfied condition\n\nClosure needs either an ABI-owned substring or report-bound observation over the same run, or an owner ruling that reprices planSatisfied."},{"pressureRef":"evidence-pressure:02-g2-same-run-suite-attribution","disposition":"pending","requirementRefs":["requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/6cec93b453f2df9b331e5908febb36e581998805218c49fab406ce4e9370a287","requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/2ac1b260a4c172edf2c948ed18390b42302657bec15407901409728e5e2e5ad3","requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/221df643ebe7e2b283bc56db2ae7e674def6ca0cdc88ba89c7b0e645ea40dd71","requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/31fcd6813562347ff58ee3be2eed9320788c8a8ea87ec9d16a71e1fb994dae55","requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/d8d166906884606b13f9a636db2c1efd2c9718e4c7984b671b0c92df67d5ebe9"],"text":"ABI gap G2 still blocks. The evidence does not attribute each suite's pass within planned-verifier-run by an admitted observation of that suite. All inputs of rule D-suite are observed true, and the stdout names both passing tests. However, the requirement forbids inferring suite passes from an aggregate count.\n\nThe separate component-suite-run and uat-suite-run passes are corroboration only.\n\nClosure needs either a per-file observation from the ABI owner or an owner ruling that reprices the attribution clause."},{"pressureRef":"evidence-pressure:03-g3-construction-basis","disposition":"pending","requirementRefs":["requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/3e9025692e1fd4b454ea40c9695fa2b37c662812a79169a50099d8fd1ab54210","requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/d3d8ed21b5d15af3a3a3bf1ccd3ff5adf06b9e202ca112bfbbc7195c5d0d54ba","requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/88958828d9af4ca553462c38b29d8514f35242708d8a0492cca59db11f457ed0","requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/9a46a12976a1020d5ab1e12524f47719058ff6b9e5bb78fff621d8f120938321"],"text":"Lifecycle gap G3 remains. A single construction activation (c-call b28cfddc…) wrote every target, so no predecessor digest is in a dependent's admitted construction basis. This affects obligations 5, 6, 9 and 12.\n\ncheck-derivation proves only named edges and cross-surface consistency, and the write order is a constructor self-report.\n\nClosure needs either staged construction activations, reached through lawful re-entry with predecessors as declared read paths, or an owner ruling that reprices the digest-basis clause."},{"pressureRef":"evidence-pressure:04-typed-observation-content-and-admission","disposition":"pending","requirementRefs":["requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/db07c18d91f1dcee127290132e58619874224e0edc21af9af0b29245818242ff","requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/6cec93b453f2df9b331e5908febb36e581998805218c49fab406ce4e9370a287"],"text":"The typed observation exists, but three things are still open:\n- It lacks an explicit observed type and argument list.\n- It binds the module digest only through its evidence coordinate.\n- It is unclassified whether it is admitted as the ABI-owned F_P typed observation under REQ-GLC-WORKSITE-LIFECYCLE-013.\n\nIt is also unconfirmed whether the evidence model admits the run record and the typed observation in the realization role (req-pressure:23)."},{"pressureRef":"evidence-pressure:05-verdict-and-evaluator-records","disposition":"pending","requirementRefs":["requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/31fcd6813562347ff58ee3be2eed9320788c8a8ea87ec9d16a71e1fb994dae55","requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/d8d166906884606b13f9a636db2c1efd2c9718e4c7984b671b0c92df67d5ebe9","requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/db07c18d91f1dcee127290132e58619874224e0edc21af9af0b29245818242ff"],"text":"The selected evidence records observed predicate values only. It contains none of the following:\n- a separate per-predicate verdict\n- the derivation output that obligation 10 requires, with each derived value\n- the recorded evaluator result for each of the four conditions that obligation 11 requires\n- a distinct comparison record for obligation 14\n\nThe fact that observed values equal declared values is established here by reading. It is not an admitted verdict."},{"pressureRef":"evidence-pressure:06-executed-environment","disposition":"unassessed","requirementRefs":["requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/31fcd6813562347ff58ee3be2eed9320788c8a8ea87ec9d16a71e1fb994dae55"],"text":"The Design and the executable capability declared environment {}. Every executed command instead carried HOME, LANG=C.UTF-8, LC_ALL=C.UTF-8, PATH and TMPDIR. Whether this runtime-supplied baseline is admitted capability behavior is unassessed. Nothing indicates that it changed subject behavior."},{"pressureRef":"evidence-pressure:07-inventory-scope","disposition":"pending","requirementRefs":["requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/206f06fea56b5a9a64d066ed597f7f3f57940ee9838caf0f2a41c2375cc8fa70","requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/627fab4b7eeee0bed12887d25fca8034acfec37855c7dd4091af9adbe4c3b80b","requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/bc22ead80214da5fb40b552a5a4045a6b8554f1130fa14c0034f01b8a12c6b47"],"text":"check-inventory ran in the helper sandbox over the 15-member command snapshot. The live post-construction inventory body (886aa227…) is not selected.\n\nIn the live worksite, the absence of extra entries rests on the construction changedPaths and the empty worksiteDelta. That covers obligations 3, 2 and 13, including the root-entries, bin and node_modules checks. The live worksite also holds .abiogenesis and semantic-assets, which are allowed and not subject content."},{"pressureRef":"evidence-pressure:08-verifier-and-check-strength","disposition":"unassessed","requirementRefs":["requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/6cec93b453f2df9b331e5908febb36e581998805218c49fab406ce4e9370a287","requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/2ac1b260a4c172edf2c948ed18390b42302657bec15407901409728e5e2e5ad3","requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/221df643ebe7e2b283bc56db2ae7e674def6ca0cdc88ba89c7b0e645ea40dd71","requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/088b36dcb16f9fc6fb6bc9b1bb35f156d0c18d2f29833287e2d9302196d903ea","requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/3e9025692e1fd4b454ea40c9695fa2b37c662812a79169a50099d8fd1ab54210","requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/d3d8ed21b5d15af3a3a3bf1ccd3ff5adf06b9e202ca112bfbbc7195c5d0d54ba"],"text":"Strength limits of the verifiers and checks:\n- No negative probe was run, so no run shows either verifier failing on a wrong greeting.\n- The document checks prove presence only. Some needles are weak: 'source' is also matched by 'component test source', and 'private' and 'module' are generic words.\n- Faithfulness of the three documents rests on independent semantic assessment."},{"pressureRef":"evidence-pressure:09-abi-readiness-classification","disposition":"unassessed","requirementRefs":["requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/31fcd6813562347ff58ee3be2eed9320788c8a8ea87ec9d16a71e1fb994dae55","requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/d8d166906884606b13f9a636db2c1efd2c9718e4c7984b671b0c92df67d5ebe9","requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/db07c18d91f1dcee127290132e58619874224e0edc21af9af0b29245818242ff"],"text":"The observed facts are:\n- test_pass_count parsed Node 24.7.0 spec-reporter output and recorded 2, 1 and 1.\n- module_export_return_exact returned a value.\n- Per-command results were recorded.\n\nREQ-GLC-ABG-REQUIREMENTS-ALGEBRA-CONSUMPTION-001/013 require each consumed capability to be classified as ready, missing, placeholder, test_only, unwired or unpinned. That classification is not recorded, and this stage does not make it. Observations of behavior in this run are not a readiness ruling."},{"pressureRef":"evidence-pressure:10-stale-requirements-asset","disposition":"pending","requirementRefs":[],"text":"The construction report states that semantic-assets/stage-2.json on disk is still the falsified Requirements candidate cef9896f, not the admitted asset 7a978d3c. This evidence uses the admitted asset. Correcting the materialization belongs to the runtime or lifecycle owner."},{"pressureRef":"evidence-pressure:11-carried-owner-rulings","disposition":"conflicting","requirementRefs":["requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/9a46a12976a1020d5ab1e12524f47719058ff6b9e5bb78fff621d8f120938321","requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/bc22ead80214da5fb40b552a5a4045a6b8554f1130fa14c0034f01b8a12c6b47","requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/d8d166906884606b13f9a636db2c1efd2c9718e4c7984b671b0c92df67d5ebe9","requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/db07c18d91f1dcee127290132e58619874224e0edc21af9af0b29245818242ff","requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/6cec93b453f2df9b331e5908febb36e581998805218c49fab406ce4e9370a287"],"text":"These questions still need an owner ruling, and this evidence decides none of them:\n- per-turn limits and sequencing\n- traversal parity\n- artifact summaries versus artifact bodies\n- the definition of planSatisfied\n- whether assertedReturnValue is a separate predicate\n- the direct-return reading\n- the UAT distinction\n- acceptor identity\n- the conformance ownership vocabulary\n- the meaning of executeFromPlan\n- the unverified witness"},{"pressureRef":"evidence-pressure:12-assessment-and-acceptance-outstanding","disposition":"pending","requirementRefs":[],"text":"Still outstanding:\n- independent semantic assessment of every bound body and of the admitted output\n- the owner's acceptance ruling\n\nThe acceptance edge stays blocked by G1 and G2, and application coverage remains non-closing."}]},"bindings":[],"design":null},"ttft_ms":404802,"type":"result","duration_ms":649993,"uuid":"b74b8f88-cc8c-499d-a276-28a182ff5f1c","ttft_stream_ms":16006,"time_to_request_ms":9549,"first_content_frame_ms":16006,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
